<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="MAT" style="id">Matthew</book>
  <para style="h">Matthew</para>
  <para style="toc1">Matthew</para>
  <para style="toc2">Matthew</para>
  <para style="mt">Matthew</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Abrahama thlah, Davida thlah, Isua Krista thlahtute inthlah dân chanchin chu:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Abrahaman Isaaka a hring a; Isaakan Jakoba a hring a; Jakoban Juda leh a unaute a hring a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Judan Tamari lakah Pharesa leh Zera a hring a; Pharesan Eroma a hring a; Eroman Arama a hring a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Araman Aminadaba a hring a; Aminadaban Nasona a hring a; Nasonan Salmona a hring a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Salmonan Rahabi lakah Boaza a hring a; Boazan Ruthi lakah Obeda a hring a; Obedan Jesaia a hring a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Jesaian Lal Davida a hring a. Tin, Davidan Uria nupui lakah Solomona a hring a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Solomonan Rehoboama a hring a; Rehoboaman Abia a hring a; Abian Asa a hring a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Asan Jehosaphata a hring a; Jehosaphatan Jehorama a hring a; Jehoraman Uzia a hring a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Uzian Jothama a hring a; Jothaman Ahaza a hring a; Ahazan Hezekia a hring a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hezekian Manasea a hring a; Manasean Amona a hring a; Amonan Josia a hring a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Babulon lama sala an hruai lai vêl khân Josian Jekonia leh a unaute a hring a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Babulon lama sala an hruai hnuin Jekonian Salathiela a hring a; Salathielan Zerubabela a hring a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Zerubabelan Abiuda a hring a; Abiudan Eliakima a hring a; Eliakiman Azora a hring a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Azoran Zadoka a hring a; Zadokan Akima a hring a; Akiman Eliuda a hring a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Eliudan Eleazara a hring a; Eleazaran Matthana a hring a; Matthanan Jakoba a hring a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jakoban Josefa, Mari pasal chu a hring a; chu mi Mari lakah chuan Isua, Krista an tih hi a lo piang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chutichuan, chhuan zawng zawng chu, Abrahama aṭanga Davida thlengin chhuan sâwm leh chhuan li a ni a; Davida aṭanga Babulon lama sala an hruai thlengin chhuan sâwm leh chhuan li a ni a; Babulon lama sala an hruai aṭanga Krista thlengin chhuan sâwm leh chhuan li a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, Isua Krista lo pian dân chu hetiang a ni: A nu Mari chu Josefa nên an inhual laiin, an inpâwl hmain, Thlarau Thianghlimin a raitîr tih an lo hre ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tichuan, a pasal tûr Josefa chu mi fel tak a ni a, tlâng thantîr a duh lo va, a rûkin bânsan a tum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nimahsela, chûng thu chu a ngaihtuah laiin ngai teh, a mangah Lalpa vântirhkoh a hnênah a lo inlâr a, “Josef, nang Davida fapa, i nupui hual Mari chu neih hlau suh; a nau pai chu Thlarau Thianghlim laka mi a ni asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Fapa a hring ang a, a hmingah Isua i sa ang; ani chuan a mite an thil tihsual lakah a chhandam dâwn si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan zâwlnei kaah, “Ngai teh, nula thianghlim chu a rai ang a, Fapa a hring ang a. A hmingah Emmanuela an sa ang,” tia a sawi kha a lo thlen theihna tûrin chûng zawng zawng chu a lo awm a ni. (Emmanuela chu “Kan hnêna Pathian awm” tihna a ni).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tichuan, Josefa chu a muhîl a tho va, Lalpa vântirhkohvin a hnêna thu a pêk ang chuan a ti a, a nupui hual chu a nei ta a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />nimahsela, fapa a hrin hma loh zawng a pâwl lo; tin, a hmingah Isua a sa ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Lal Heroda a lal laia, Judai rama Bethlehem khuaa Isua a lo pianin, ngai teh, khawchhak lam ata mi fingte Jerusalem khuaah an lo kal a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Khawiah nge Juda-te lal lo piang chu? Khawchhak lamah a arsi kan hmu a, amah chibai bûk tûrin kan lo kal a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Lal Heroda chuan chu chu a hriat veleh a mangang ta a, Jerusalem-a mi zawng zawng pawh an mangang ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tichuan, puithiam lalte leh lehkhaziaktute zawng zawng a ko khâwm a, Krista pianna tûr chu a zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, anni chuan a hnênah, “Judai rama Bethlehem khuaah; heti hian zâwlneiin a ziak kha:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />‘Nang, Bethlehem, Judai rama mi, Judai khawpuite zîngah i tê ber tawp lo! I chhûng aṭangin awptu a lo chhuak dâwn si a, Ka mi Israel-hote vêngtu tûr chu,’ tih hi,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chumi hnuah chuan Herodan a rûkin mi fingte chu a ko va, dîlchhût takin arsi lan lai chu a zâwt chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, anni chu Bethlehem khuaah a kaltîr a, “Kal ta ula, naute thu chu dîlchhût takin zâwt chhuak rawh u; tin, kei pawhin amah chu chibai ka rawn bûk ve theih nân, in hmuh veleh mi rawn hrilh ang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, lal thu chu an hria a, an kal ta a; tin, ngai teh, khawchhak lama arsi an hmuh kha, naute awmna chung zâwn a thlena a din hma loh zawng an hmaah a kal zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, arsi chu an hmuhin an hlim nasa êm êm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, in chhûngah an va lût a, a nu Mari hnêna nautê chu an hmu a, an bawkkhup a, chibai an bûk a; tin, an ro bâwmte an hawng a, a hnênah chuan lawmna rangkachak te, beraw te, murra te an pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Heroda hnênah kîr leh lo tûrin an manga hrilha an awm avângin, anmahni khaw lamah kawng dangah an haw ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, an hâwn hnuin ngai teh, Lalpa vântirhkoh Josefa hnênah a mangah a inlâr a, “Tho la, nautê leh a nu hruai la, Aigupta ramah tlân bo rawh, ka hrilh leh hma loh che zawng chutah chuan awm reng ang che; Herodan nautê tiboral tûrin a zawng dâwn a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tichuan, a tho va, a zân a zânin nautê leh a nu chu a hruai a, Aigupta ramah a kal ta a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />tin, Heroda thih hma loh zawng chutah chuan a awm reng a: Lalpan zâwlnei kaah, “Ka fapa chu Aigupta ram ata ka ko chhuak a,” tia a sawi kha a lo thlen theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chutih lai chuan mi fingte tihder a nih a inhriat veleh Heroda chu a thinur êm êm a, mi a tîr a, a hun lai tak thu dîlchhût taka mi fingte a zawh chhuah ang khân, Bethlehem khua leh a vêl zawng zawnga mipa naupang kum hnih achin hnuai lam chu an zain a that ta vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chutih lai chuan zâwlnei Jeremian, “Rama khuaah thâwm an hria, Ṭap te, mitthi ngaia chiau vawng vawng te; Rakili chuan a fate a ṭah a, An awm tawh loh avângin a thlamuan theih loh,” tia a sawi kha a lo thleng ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nimahsela, Heroda chu a thih hnuin ngai teh, Lalpa vântirhkoh chu Aigupta ramah Josefa hnênah a mangah a inlâr a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Tho la, nautê leh a nu hruai la, Israel ramah kal rawh: naute thah tumte kha an thi tawh e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tichuan, a tho va, nautê leh a nu chu a hruai a, Israel ramah a lût ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nimahsela, Arkelausa chu a pa Heroda aiawhin Judai ramah a lal tih a hriatin chuta kal chu a hlau ta a; tin, a manga hrilha a awm avângin Galili lamah a kal ta daih a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />khaw pakhat Nazareth an tihah chuan a va awm ta a: “Ani chu ‘Nazareth mi’ an ti ang,” tia zâwlneite kâa an sawi kha a lo thlen theih nân.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, chûng lai chuan Baptistu Johana chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Sim rawh u; vânram chu a hnai tawh e,” tiin Judai thlalêrah thu hrilin a lo kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amah chu a ni, zâwlnei Isaian, “Thlalêra mi au râwl chuan, ‘Lalpa lamlian sial ula, A kawngte tingîl rawh u,’ a ti,” tia a sawia kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, chu mi Johana chuan sanghâwngsei hmul puan a sin a, a kâwng chu savun kâwnghrênin a hrêng a; a chaw chu khaukhuap leh khawizu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chumi lai chuan Jerusalem khuaa mi te, Judai rama mi zawng zawng te, Jordan lui dung vêla mi zawng zawngte chu an chhuak a, a hnên lamah an kal a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />an sualte thupha chawiin Jordan luiah chuan a hnênah baptisma an chang ta hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nimahsela, Pharisaite leh Saddukaite tam tak a baptisma chang tûra lo kal a hmuh veleh an hnênah, “Rûl thlahte u! Thinur lo thleng tûr hi tlânsan tûrin tuin nge zilh che u?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chutichuan, sim hming pu tlâkin rah rawh u:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />‘Abrahama kan thlahtu a ni alâwm,’ tiin inngaihtuah suh u; Pathianin hêng lungte hi Abrahama thlahahte a dintîr thei e, ka tih che u hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tûn apangin thingbul tinah hreipui an dah ta; chutichuan, thing tin rah ṭhaa rah lo apiang an kit a, meiah an paih ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kei zawngin in simna tûrin tuiin ka baptis ṭhîn che u a; nimahsela, ka hnunga lo kal tûr chu keimah aiin a ropui zâwk a, a pheikhawk keng tlâk pawh ka ni lo ve. Ani chuan Thlarau Thianghlim leh meiin a baptis ang che u;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />a kutin a sisêp a keng a, a hruih a zâp fai hliau ang a, zêmah chuan a buh a khung ang, a sî erawh chu mei mit thei lovin a hâl ral ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chumi lai chuan a hnêna baptisma chang tûrin, Galili ram aṭangin Jordan luiah Johana hnênah Isua a lo kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Johana erawh chuan, “I mi baptis ka ṭûl zâwk si a, ka hnênah i lo kal zâwk a ni maw?” tiin khap a tum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nimahsela, Isuan a hnênah, “Tûnah remti hrâm rawh, hetianga felna zawng zawng hlen chhuah hi kan tân a mawi a ni,” tiin a chhâng a. Tichuan, rem a ti ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Isua chu baptisma a chan veleh tui ata a chhuak ta nghâl a; tin, ngai teh, a tân vân a lo inhawng a, Pathian Thlarau chu ṭhuro anga lo chhukin, a chunga lo fu a hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, ngai teh, vân aṭangin awin, “Hei hi ka Fapa duh tak, ka lawm êm êma chu a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chumi zawhah chuan Isua chu Diabola thlêma awm tûrin thlalêrah Thlarau hruai luhin a awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, ni sawmli leh zan sawmli a nghei hnuin a ril a lo ṭâm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, thlêmtu chu a lo kal a, a hnênah, “Pathian Fapa i nih chuan hêng lung hi chhanga chang tûrin thu pe rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nimahsela, ani chuan, “ ‘Mihring hi chhang chauhvin an nung lo vang a, Pathian kâa thu tin chhuakin an nung zâwk ang,’ tih ziak a ni,” tiin a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chumi zawhah chuan Diabolan khaw thianghlimah chuan a hruai lût a, Pathian biak in chhîp zumah chuan a dah a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />tin, a hnênah, “Pathian Fapa i nih chuan tla thla rawh; ‘I chung thûah zawng a vântirhkohte chu thu a pe ang a, An kutin an dâwm ang chia; Chuti lo chuan, i kein lung i chhuih hlauh dah ang e,’ tih ziak a ni si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Isuan a hnênah,“ ‘Lalpa i Pathian fiah suh,’ tih ziak a ni ve bawk e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Diabola chuan tlâng sâng takah a hruai leh a, khawvêl ram zawng zawng leh a ropuina chu a entîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, a hnênah, “Bawkkhupin chibai mi bûk la, hêng zawng zawng hi ka pe vek ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chu veleh Isuan a hnênah, “Setan, kal bo daih rawh! ‘Lalpa i Pathian chibai bûk la, ama rawng chauh bâwl rawh,’ tih ziak a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chumi hnuah chuan Diabola chuan a kalsan ta a. Tin, ngai teh, vântirhkohten a rawng an rawn bâwlsak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Johana an man tih Isuan a hriat veleh Galili ramah a kal ta daih a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />tin, Nazareth khua a kalsan a, Kapernaum khuaah a awm ta reng a (chu chu Zebulon leh Naphtali biala, dîl kama awm a ni).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Zâwlnei Isaia kâah, “Dîl kamah, Jordan râlah, Zebulon ram leh Naphtali ram, Jentail-te Galili chu!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Thim hnuaia ṭhute chuan êng nasa tak an hmu a, Thihna hmun leh a hlima ṭhute chungah chuan, Eng a lo chhuak ta a,” tia a sawi kha a lo thlen theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chuta chinah chuan Isuan, “Sim rawh u; vânram chu a hnai tawh e,” tiin a hril ṭan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, Galili dîl kama a lên pahin, unau pahnih, Petera tia koh Simona leh a unau Andria chu, dîlah chuan lên dêngin a hmu a; sangha mantu an ni rêng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan an hnênah, “Mi zui rawh u; tichuan, mihring mantuah ka siam ang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, lênte chu kalsanin an zui ta nghâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, chuta ṭang chuan a kal zêl a, unau dang pahnih, Zebedaia fapa Jakoba leh a unau Johana chu, an pa Zebedaia hnênah lawngah an lênte siam ṭhain a hmu a; tin, anni chu a ko ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tichuan, lawng leh an pa chu an kalsan a, an zui ta nghâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, Isuan an inkhâwmna inahte zirtîrin, Ram Chanchin Ṭha chu hrilin, mite zînga natna tinrêng leh chak lohna tinrêng tidamin, Galili ram zawng zawng a fang vêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, Suria ram zawng zawngah a chanchin a thang ta a; tichuan, mi damlo zawng zawng, damlohna leh natna tinrêng tuarte, ramhuai mante, thla em âtte, zengte a hnênah an rawn hruai a; a lo tidam hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Galili ram aṭang te, Dekapoli khua aṭang te, Jerusalem khua aṭang te, Judai ram aṭang te, Jordan râl aṭang te chuan mipui tam takin amah an zui bawk a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tichuan, mipuite chu a hmuhin tlângah a kal chho va; tin, a ṭhu a, a zirtîrte a hnênah an lo kal a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />tin, thu a sawi a, anmahni a zirtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Rilrua retheite chu an eng a thâwl e; Vânram an ta a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lungngaite chu an eng a thâwl e; thlamuanin an la awm dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thuhnuairawlhte chu an eng a thâwl e; Lei hi an la rochung dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Felnaa rilṭâma tuihâlte chu an eng a thâwl e; An la tlai dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi khawngaih thei takte chu an eng a thâwl e; Khawngaih an la hlawh dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thinlunga thianghlimte chu an eng a thâwl e; Pathian an la hmu dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Remna siamtute chu an eng a thâwl e; Pathian faa vuahin an la awm dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Felna avânga tihduhdah tuar hnute chu an êng a thâwl e; Vânram an ta a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Miin keimah avânga an hau che ua, an tihduhdah che ua, dâwta sual tinrênga an hêk hunah che u, in eng a la thâwl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lâwm ulangin, nasa takin hlim rawh u; vânah in lâwmman a awm hnem si a; chutiang bawkin in hmaa zâwlnei awmte pawh an tihduhdah ṭhin kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lei chi in ni e; nimahsela, chi hi a dâk tawh chuan engin nge an tihal leh ang? Chuta chinah chuan paih chhuaha, mihringte rah mai mai chauhvah lo chuan, eng atân mah a tlâktlai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Khawvêl êng in ni e. Tlâng chhîpa khaw awm chu thuhrûk theih a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Miin khâwnvâr hâlin hrai hnuaiah an dah ngai lo, a dahnaah an dah zâwk ṭhîn; tichuan, in chhûnga mi zawng zawng a ên ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chutiang bawkin in êng chu mi mit hmuhin êng rawh se; chutichuan, in thiltih ṭhatte an hmu ang a, in Pa vâna mi an chawimawi thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Dân thu emaw, zâwlneite thu emaw tiboral tûra lo kal ka nih ring suh u; tiboral tûra lo kal ka ni lo va, tifamkim tûra lo kal ka ni zâwk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tihtak meuhvin ka hrilh a che u, lei leh vân hi a boral hma loh chuan dân thûa mi chhun han tê tak tê emaw, thai han tê tak tê emaw, pakhat mah a boral tawp lo vang, a zaa a thlen kim hma loh zawng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chutichuan, tu pawh hêng thupêk tê ber zîngah hian pakhat pawh bawhchhiaa, chutiang ti ve tûra mite zirtîr apiang chu, vânramah chuan mi tê ber an ti ang; amaherawhchu, tu pawh zâwma, zirtîr ve apiang chu, vânramah chuan mi lian an ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />In felnain lehkhaziaktute leh Pharisaite felna hi a khûm loh chuan, vânramah in lût tawp lo vang tih ka hrilh che u a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hmânlaia mite hnênah chuan, ‘Tualthah tûr a ni lo,’ an tih leh, ‘Tu pawh tual that apiang chu a chung thu rêl a ni ang,’ tih a nih in hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kei erawh chuan ka hrilh a che u, tu pawh a unau chunga thinur apiang chu, a chung thu rêl a ni ang a; tu pawh a unau, ‘mi chhawihpa,’ ti apiang chu, rorêlna sânga a chung thu rêl a ni ang; tin, tu pawh, ‘mi âpa,’ ti apiang chu, Gehenna meia kal tlâk a ni ang tih ka hrilh a che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chutichuan, maichâm bula thilpêk i hlan lai ngeia, i unauvin i chungah lungnih lohna a nei tih i hriat chhuah leh chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />chuta maichâm hmaah chuan i thilpêk chu hnutchhiah la, kal langin, i unau chu rem zet la, chumi hnuah chuan i thilpêk chu rawn hlân rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />I khingpui chu kalkawnga in kal dun laiin rem thuai rawh; chuti lo chuan, i khingpui chuan rorêltu a mantîr ang chia, rorêltu chuan tiangkengtu hnênah chuan a pe ang chia, tân inah an khung hlauh dah ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tihtak meuhvin ka hrilh a che, pawisa tê pawh i tlâk kim hma loh chuan, chuta ta chu i chhuak lo hul hual ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />‘I uire tûr a ni lo,’ an ti tih in hre tawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Kei erawh chuan, tu pawh ngaih châka hmeichhia melh apiang chu, a thinlungah a uire tawh reng a ni tih ka hrilh a che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, i mit ding lamin a tihtlûk che chuan, kher chhuak la, paih daih rawh; i taksa a puma Gehenna-a paih ai chuan, i taksa pêng pakhat boral chu i tân a ṭha zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, i kut ding lamin a tihtlûk che chuan, tan la, paih daih rawh; i taksa a puma Gehenna-a kal ai chuan, i taksa pêng pakhat boral chu i tân a ṭha zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />‘Tu pawh nupui ma apiang chuan inmâkna lehkha a hnênah pe rawh se,’ an ti bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Kei erawh chuan, tu pawh tlangvâl ngaih vâng ni lova nupui ma apiang chuan, amah chu a uiretîr a ni; tin, tu pawh mâk hnu nei apiang chu a uire a ni tih ka hrilh a che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />“Hmânlaia mite hnênah, ‘Dâwtah chhia chham suh la, Lalpa hnênah i chhechhamte chu hlen zâwk rawh,’ an ti tih in hre tawh bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Kei erawh chuan ka hrilh a che u, chhia rêng rêng chham suh u; vân chhâlin chham suh u, chu chu Pathian lalṭhutphah a ni si a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />lei chhâlin chham hek suh u, chu chu a ke nghahchhan a ni si a; Jerusalem chhâlin chham hek suh u, chu chu Lal ropui tak khawpui a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />I lû chhâlin i chham tûr a ni hek lo, samzai pakhat pawh i tivârin i tidum thei si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Nimahsela, in thusawi chu ‘a ni’ chu ni, ‘a ni lo’ chu ni lo ni mai rawh se; chûng aia chuang aliam chu sual laka chhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />‘Mit aiah mit, ha aiah ha,’ an ti tih in hre tawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Kei erawh chuan ka hrilh a che u, mi sual dodâl suh u; i biang ding lama bêngtu hnênah chuan a lehlam pawh dawh rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tin, tu pawhin i lakah thupawi siamin, i kawr lâk a tum chuan, i puan pawh lâktîr nghâl rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tin, mêl khat kala phût luitu apiang che hnênah chuan mêl hnih kal rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />A dîltu che hnênah pe la, i laka pûk duhtu chu hawisan suh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />‘I vêngte hmangaih la, i hmêlma haw rawh,’ an ti tih in hre tawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Kei erawh chuan ka hrilh a che u, in hmêlmate chu hmangaih ula, a tiduhdahtu che u chu ṭawngṭaisak rawh u,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />in Pa vâna mi fate in nih theih nân; ani chuan mi sualte leh mi ṭhate chungah chuan a nî a chhuahtîr ṭhîn a, mi felte leh mi fel lote chungah pawh ruah a sûrtîr ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />In hmangaitute chauh in hmangaih hian lâwmman eng nge in hmuh ang? Chhiahkhawntute pawhin chutiangin an ti ve lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Tin, in unaute chauh chibai in bûk hian eng nge in tih hnem chuan bîk? Jentail-te pawhin chutiangin an ti ve lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Chutichuan, in Pa vâna mi a ṭha famkim angin in ṭha famkim tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />In thil ṭha tihte mi hmuh atân, mihring mit hmuha ti lo tûrin fîmkhur rawh u; chuti lo chuan, in Pa vâna mi hnênah chuan lâwmman in nei lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chutichuan, mi hnêna englo i pêkin, mi vervêkten mi fak an hlawh theihna tûra inkhâwmna inahte, kawtthlêrahte an tih ṭhin ang hian, i hmaah tawtawrâwt hamtîr suh. Tihtak meuhvin ka hrilh a che u, an lâwmman chu an hmu zo tawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nang erawh chuan mi hnêna englo i pêkin, i kut ding lamin a tih chu i kut vei lamin hre suh se,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />i englo pêk chu a rûkin a awm theih nân; chutichuan, i Pa a rûka hmu ṭhîntu chuan a rûl ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, in ṭawngṭaiin, mi vervêkte angin in ti tûr a ni lo; miin an hmuh theihna tûrin inkhâwmna inah te, kawtthlêr pêng takah te, ding chunga ṭawngṭai an ngaina si ṭhîn a. Tihtak meuhvin ka hrilh a che u, an lâwmman chu an hmu zo tawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nang erawh chu i ṭawngṭaiin, i pindan chhûngrilah lût la, i kawng khâr la, i Pa a rûka awm hnênah chuan ṭawngṭai rawh; tichuan, i Pa a rûka hmu ṭhîntu chuan a rûl ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, in ṭawngṭaiin, Jentail-te angin sawi nawn mai mai suh u; an ṭawng tam avângin hriain an ring a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chutichuan, anmahni angin awm suh u; amah in dîl hmain in Pa chuan engte nge in mamawh tih a hre reng si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chutichuan, nangni chu hetiang hian ṭawngṭai rawh u: ‘Kan Pa, vâna mi, I hming zahawm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />I ram lo thleng rawh se. I duh zâwng vâna an tih angin leia mi’n ti rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Vawiinah hian kan ei khawpin chaw min pe ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kan batte hi min ngaidam ang che, Keini pawhin kan englo bâte kan ngaihdam tâk ang khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sual tûra thlêmnaah min hruai lût suh la, Mi sual lakah chuan min chhandam zâwk ang che,’ tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mi an bawhchhiatte in ngaihdam chuan, in Pa vâna miin a ngaidam ve ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nimahsela, mite in ngaihdam si loh chuan, in Pain in bawhchhiatte a ngaidam bîk lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chaw in nghei hun pawhin, mi vervêkte angin ngui hmêl pu suh u; anni zawngin mi mit hmuha chaw ngheia an lan theihna tûrin an hmêl an tipawr si ṭhîn a. Tihtak meuhvin ka hrilh a che u, an lâwmman chu an hmu zo tawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nang erawh chuan chaw i nghei hunin sahriak thih la, i hmai phih rawh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />chutichuan, i Pa a rûka awm mit hmuhah chauh lo chuan, mihring mit hmuhah chaw ngheiin i lang lo vang; tichuan, i Pa a rûka hmu ṭhîntu chuan a rûl ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Leia sûlrûl leh tuiêkin a ei chhiatnaah, rûkruten an reh pawha an rûknaah hian, in tân rote khâwl khâwm suh u;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />vânah, sûlrûl leh tuiêkin a ei chhiat lohnaah, rûkruten an reh pawha an rûk hek lohnaah chuan, in tân rote khâwl khâwm zâwk rawh u;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />i ro awmna apiangah i rilru pawh a awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Taksa khâwnvâr chu mit hi a ni; chutichuan, i mit a fîm chuan i taksa a pumin a êng chhuak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />I mit a chhiat erawh chuan i taksa a pumin a thim zo vek ang. Chutichuan, i chhûnga êng chu thim ni sela, thim chu a va nasa dâwn êm!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tu mân hotu pahnih rawng an bâwl kawp thei lo: pakhat huain pakhat an duh ang; a nih loh leh, pakhat ṭanin pakhat an hmusit ang. Pathian leh sum rawng in bâwl kawp thei lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Chuvângin, ka hrilh a che u, ‘Eng nge ka ei anga, eng nge ka in ang aw?’ tiin in nunna thu leh, ‘Eng nge ka silhin ka fên ang aw?’ tiin in taksa thu lungkham suh u. Ei tûr aiin nunna a thupui zâwk lo vem ni? Silhfên aiin taksa pawh a thupui zâwk lo vem ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chunglêng savate hi en rawh u; buh an tuh lo va, an ât hek lo, buh inah an seng lût hek lo; nimahsela, in Pa vâna mi chuan a châwm si a. Nangni chu anni ai chuan nasa takin in hlu zâwk lo vem ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, nangni zîngah lungkham avângin tuin nge mahni dung lam tawng khata tisâng chuang thei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, silhfên thu engah nge in lungkham ni? Ram tûktinpâr ṭhanzia hi ṭha takin ngaihtuah rawh u; hna an thawk lo, la pawh an kai hek lo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />nimahsela, ka hrilh a che u, Solomona meuh pawh a ropuina zawng zawnga a inthuam khân, hêng tûktinpâr pakhat tluk pawh hian cheiin a awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Chutichuan, ram hnim, vawiin anga nung, a tûka thuka tuah leh mai tûr mah Pathianin chuti kauva a chei chuan, aw nangni rin tlêmte u, silhfên a pe zâwk êm êm dâwn lo che u em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chutichuan, ‘Eng nge kan ei ang?’ emaw, ‘Eng nge kan in ang?’ emaw, ‘Eng sinin nge kan awm ang?’ tih emaw lungkham suh u,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Jentail-ten chûng zawng zawng chu an zawng ṭhîn a ni. Chûng zawng zawng chu in mamawh tih in Pa vâna mi’n a hre reng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />A ram leh a felna chu zawng hmasa zâwk rawh u; tichuan, chûng zawng zawng chu a pêk belhchhah dâwn che u nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Chutichuan, a tûk atân lungkham suh u, a tûk chuan ama tân a lungkham chawp dâwn si a. Ni khat atân ni khat hrehawm chu a tâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sawisêl suh u, sawisêla in awm loh nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />In sawisêl ang bawkin an sawisêl ang che ua, in tehna ngai bawkin an tehsak leh ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, engati nge mahni mita khanchhuk awm chu ngaihtuah si lovin, i unau mita hmawlh tê tak tê awm chu i hmuh ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Engtin nge i unau hnênah, ‘I mit ata hmawlh tê tak tê kha mi lâk chhuahtîr rawh,’ i tih theih ang? Ngai teh, nangma mit ngeiah khanchhuk a awm reng si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi vervêk! I mit ata khanchhuk kha la chhuak hmasa rawh; chutichuan, i unau mit ata hmawlh tê tak tê lâk chhuah tûr chu fiah takin i hmu ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ui hnênahte thil thianghlim chu pe suh u; vawk hmaahte in tuikeplungte paih hek suh u, an chîl chhe hlauh ang a; hawiin an tai thlêr dah ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Dîl rawh u, tichuan, an pe ang che u; zawng rawh u, tichuan, in hmu ang; kik rawh u, tichuan, an hawnsak ang che u;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />tu pawh a dîl apiang chuan an hmu ṭhîn a; tu pawh a zawng chuan an hmu ṭhîn a; tu pawh a kik chu an hawnsak dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A nih leh, nangniho hi tu pawh in fapain chhangpêr dîl che u sela, tuin nge lung pe ang che u?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A nih leh, sangha dîl che u sela, tuin nge rûl pe ang che u?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chutichuan, nangni mi sual mahin in fate thil ṭha pêk nachâng in hriat chuan, in Pa vâna mi chuan a dîltute chu thil ṭha a pe zâwk êm êm dâwn lo vem ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chutichuan, thil engkim miin in chunga an tiha in duh tûr ang apiang chu, mi chungah pawh ti ve rawh u; chu chu dân thu leh zâwlneite thu a ni rêng si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kawngka zîmah chuan lût rawh u; boralnaa kalna kawngka chu a zau va, a kawng pawh a zau bawk a, chumi lama lût chu tam pawh an tam hle a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />nunnaa kalna kawngka chu a zîm a, a kawng pawh a chêp bawk a, a hmutute pawh tlêm tê an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Zâwlnei derte lakah fîmkhur rawh u; chûng chu berâm vun sinin in hnênah an lo kal ṭhîn a, an chhûng lamah erawh chuan chinghne koham takte an ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Anmahni chu an rahah in hre mai ang. Hruihlîngnei kûngah grêp rah an lo ngai em ni? Lênhlîngah pawh theipui an lo ngai em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chutiang bawkin thing ṭha apiang a rah ṭha ṭhîn a; thing chhia erawh chu a rah chhe ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thing ṭha a rah chhe thei lo va, thing chhia lah a rah ṭha thei hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Thing tin rah ṭha lo apiang chu an kit a, meiah an paih ṭhin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chuvângin, anmahni chu an rahah in hre mai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />‘Lalpa, Lalpa’ mi ti nazawng chu vânramah an lût lo vang a; ka Pa vâna mi duh zâwng titu erawh chu an lût ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chumi nîah chuan mi tam takin, ‘Lalpa, Lalpa, i hmingin thute kan sawiin, i hmingin ramhuaite kan hnawt chhuakin, i hmingin thilmak tam tak kan ti ṭhîn lo vem ni?’ an la ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chumi hunah chuan, ‘Nangni thil sual tite u, ka hre ngai lo va che u, ka hnên ata kal bo rawh u,’ tiin anni chu ka la hrilh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chutichuan, mi tin hêng ka thu hi hriaa zâwm apiang chu, mi fing, lungpui chunga in satu nên tehkhin tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ruahte a lo sûr a, tuite a lo lian a, thlite a lo tleh a, chu in chu a rawn nam sawk sawk a; nimahsela, a chim lo va; lungpui chunga rem tlat a nih avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, mi tin, hêng ka thu hi hriaa zâwm lo apiang chu, mi â, ṭiauvut chung maia in satu nên tehkhin tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ruahte a lo sûr a, tuite a lo lian a, thlite a lo tleh a, chu in chu a rawn nam sawk sawk a; a chim ta a; a sawp chu nasa tak a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, Isuan chûng thu chu a sawi zawh veleh, mipuiten a thu zirtîr chu mak an ti hle a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />lehkhaziaktute ang lova thuneihna nei âwm taka anmahni a zirtîr avângin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, tlâng ata chu a lo chhuk hnuin mipui tam takin amah an zui ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, ngai teh, a hnênah phâr a lo kal a, “Lalpa, i duh chuan mi tithianghlim thei e,” tiin chibai a bûk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Isuan a han ban a, a dek a, “Ka duh e, lo thianghlim tawh ang che,” a ti a. Tin, chawplehchilhin a phâr chu a lo thianghlim ta nghâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Isuan a hnênah, “Tu mah hrilh lo tûrin fîmkhur ang che; amaherawhchu, kal la, puithiam hnênah va inentîr la, Mosian thilpêk tûr a ruat kha hlân rawh, an hriat fiahna tûrin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Kapernaum khuaa a luhin, a hnênah sipai za hotu a lo kal a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Lalpa, ka naupang zengin inah a mu reng a, nasa taka tihnatin a awm a ni,” tiin a ngên chiam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan a hnênah, “Ka lo kal ang a, ka tidam ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, sipai za hotu chuan, “Lalpa, ka in chhûng i luhna tlâk a ni lo ve; thu chauh sawi la, ka naupang a dam mai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kei pawh mi thûa awm ka ni a, ka hnuaiah sipaite an awm a; chu mi chu, ‘Kal rawh,’ ka tih leh a kal ṭhîn; mi dang hnênah pawh, ‘Lo haw rawh,’ ka tih leh a lo haw ṭhîn; ka bâwih hnênah pawh, ‘Hei hi ti rawh,’ ka tih leh a ti ṭhîn,” tiin a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Isuan chûng thu chu a hriatin mak a ti hle a, a zuitute hnênah chuan, “Tihtak meuhvin ka hrilh a che u, Israel-te zîngah pawh heti êma rinna nasa hi ka hmu lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka hrilh a che u, chhak leh thlang aṭangin mi tam tak an lo kal ang a, vânramah chuan Abrahama te, Isaaka te, Jakoba te hnênah an ṭhu ang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />ram fate erawh chu pâwn thimah chuan hnawh chhuahin an awm ang a; chutah chuan ṭah leh ha ṭhial chu a awm ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Isuan sipai za hotu hnênah chuan, “Kal tawh rawh, i rin angin i chungah lo thleng rawh se,” a ti a. Tichuan, naupang chu chumi dâr ngeiah chuan a lo dam ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Isua chu Petera ina a luhin, a nupuia nu chu khawsika mu a hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tichuan, a kut chu a dehsak a, a khawsik chu a reh ta a; tin, a tho va, a rawng a bâwlsak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, khua a lo tlai lam chuan, a hnênah ramhuai mante tam tak an rawn hruai a; tin, thuin ramhuaite chu a hnawt chhuak a, damlo zawng zawngte chu a tidam bawk a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Zâwlnei Isaian, “Amah ngeiin kan chak lohnate a la a, kan nâte a phur a,” tia a sawi chu a lo thlen theihna tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, Isuan mipui tam tak a vêla a hmuhin, râl lehlama kal tûrin thu a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, lehkhaziaktu pakhat a lo kal a, a hnênah, “Zirtîrtu, i kalna apiangah ka zui ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, Isuan a hnênah, “Sihalten kua an nei a, chunglêng savate pawhin bu an nei a, Mihring Fapa erawh hi chuan a lû nghahna a nei lo,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, a zirtîrte zînga mi dangin a hnênah, “Lalpa, ka pa mi vuitîr zet rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nimahsela, ani chuan a hnênah, “Mi zui rawh; mitthiin anmahni mitthi chu vui rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, lawngah a chuang a, zirtîrte chuan an zui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, ngai teh, dîl chu nasa takin a lo fâwn ta a; chutichuan, tuifâwnin lawng chu a vûr hlup hlup mai a; ani erawh chu a muhîl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, a hnênah an lo kal a, an kai tho va, “Lalpa, min chhanhim rawh, kan boral dâwn hi le,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan an hnênah, “Rin tlêmte u, engah nge in hlauh?” a ti a. Chumi hnuah chuan a tho va, thlite leh dîl chu a hau va; tin, a lo reh ta ṭhuap mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, mite chuan mak an ti hle a, “He mi hi mi eng nge a nih, thli leh dîl lam pawhin a thu an âwih hi?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, râl lehlam, Gadarin mite ram chu a thlenin, ramhuai man pahnih, thlân aṭanga lo chhuakin an rawn tâwk a, an kawlh êm êm a; chutichuan, chumi kawngah chuan tu mah an kal thei lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, ngai teh, anni chuan, “Pathian Fapa, keini leh nang eng nge kan inzâwlna? Hun tiam thlen hmain min nghaisa tûrin hetah i lo kal em ni?” tiin an au va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, an awmna aṭanga hla feah vawk rual tam tak an tla a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, ramhuaite chuan, “Min hnawh chhuah chuan vawk rual kawchhûngahte sâwn min kaltîr ang che,” tiin a hnênah an ngên a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan an hnênah, “Kal ta che u,” a ti a. Tichuan, an lo chhuak a, vawk kawchhûngahte chuan an va lût a; tin, ngai teh, vawk rual zawng zawng chu khâmah an tlân chhuk chiam a, dîlah an tlân lût a, tuiah chuan an boral ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tin, a vulhtute chu an tlân a, khuaah chuan an kal a, engkim an hrilh ta a, ramhuai mante chunga thil lo thlengte pawh chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tin, ngai teh, a khuain Isua hmuak tûrin an lo chhuak a; tin, amah an hmuh veleh an ram ata chhuak tûrin an ngên chiam a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Isua chu lawngah a chuang a, dîl chu a kân a, a awmna khua chu a thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, ngai teh, zeng pakhat khuma mu chungin a hnênah an rawn zâwn a. Tin, Isuan an rinzia a hmuhin, zeng hnênah chuan, “Ka fa, thlamuang takin awm rawh; i sualte ngaihdam a ni tawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, ngai teh, lehkhaziaktu ṭhenkhatte chuan an rilruin, “He mi hian Pathian a sawi chhia a nih hi,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Isuan an ngaihtuahte chu a lo hria a, “Engah nge in thinlunga sual in ngaihtuah ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />‘I sualte ngaihdam a ni tawh,’ tih leh, ‘Tho la, kein kal tawh rawh,’ tih hi a eng nge sawi awl zâwk ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Eng pawh ni sela, khawvêlah Mihring Fapa hian sual ngaihdam theihna a nei tih in hriat nân,” a ti a, (zeng hnênah chuan) “Tho la, i khum la la, i inah kal rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, a tho va, a inah a haw ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, mipuite chuan chu chu an hmuhin an hlau va, mihringte hnêna chutiang thuneihna petu Pathian chu an fak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Isua chu chuta ṭang chuan a kal zêl a, chhiah chawina hmuna ṭhu mi pakhat, a hming Matthaia a hmu a; tin, a hnênah, “Mi rawn zui rawh,” a ti a. Tichuan, a tho va, a zui ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, inah chuan chaw a kîl laiin, ngai teh, chhiahkhawntute leh mi sualte tam tak an lo kal a, Isua leh a zirtîrte chu an kîlpui hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Pharisaite chuan chu chu an hmuhin a zirtîrte hnênah chuan, “Engati nge in zirtîrtuin chhiahkhawntute leh mi sualte hnêna a ei le?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nimahsela, Isuan chu chu a hriat veleh, “Mi chakte chuan dâktawr an ngai lo va, mi bawrhsâwmte zâwkin an ngai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chutichuan, ‘Inthawina duh lovin khawngaihna ka duh e,’ tih hi a awmzia va zir rawh u; mi fel takte lam tûra lo kal ka ni lo va, mi sualte zâwk lam tûra lo kal ka ni asin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chumi lai chuan Johana zirtîrte chu a hnênah an lo kal a, “Engati nge keini leh Pharisaite hian chaw kan nghei zut ṭhina, i zirtîrte lêmin an nghei si loh?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Isuan an hnênah, “Mo hruaitute hnênah a pasal tûr chu a awm chhûng zawng, mo hruaitute chuan an sûn thei em ni? Nimahsela, a pasal tûr chu an hnên ata hruai bo nite a la thleng ang a, chumi hunah erawh chuan chaw an la nghei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, tu mân puan hlui puan la thlâk mar loh themin an bel ngai lo; a bel phuina tûr chuan puan chu a kai thlêr zâwk ang a, a lo thlêr nasa lehzual dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tu mân uain thar savun uain peng hluiahte an thun ngai hek lo; chuti lo chuan, savun pengte chu a puak keh a, uain chu a bua a, savun pengte pawh chu a lo chhe ṭhîn; uain thar chu savun uain peng tharahte an thun zâwk ṭhîn a ni; tichuan, ṭha takin a awm ve ve ṭhîn,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chûng thu chu an hnêna a sawi lai takin, ngai teh, hotu pakhat a lo kal a, chibai a bûk a, “Ka fanu tûnah tak hian a thi a; nimahsela, lo kal la, a chungah i kut nghat la, a lo nung leh mai ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tichuan, Isua chu a tho va, a zui ta a, zirtîrte pawhin an zui ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, ngai teh, hmeichhe pakhat, kum sâwm leh kum hnih thi pûta damlo hi a hnungah a lo kal a, a puan hmâwr a dek a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“A puan hmâwr chauh pawh dek ila, tihdamin ka awm mai ang,” a tirilru a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, Isua a hawi a, amah chu a hmu a, “Ka fanu, thlamuang takin awm rawh; i rinna hi i dampui a ni e,” a ti a. Tichuan, hmeichhia chu chumi dâr achinah chuan a lo dam ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, Isua chu hotu inah chuan a lût a, phênglâwng tumte leh mipui bengchheng mur murte a va hmuh chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Chhuak rawh u; naupang chu a thi lo ve, a muhîl a ni zâwk asin,” a ti a. Tin, anni chuan amah chu an nuihsan ta mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nimahsela, mipui chu an hnawh chhuah hnu chuan a lût a, a kutah a chelh a, naupang chu a lo tho ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, chu chanchin chu chûng ram zawng zawngah chuan a lo thang chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, Isua chu chuta ṭang chuan a kal zêl a, mitdel pahnihin, “Davida fapa, min khawngaih rawh,” tia auvin an zui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, ina a luh chuan mitdelte chu a hnênah an lo kal a; tin, Isuan an hnênah, “Hei hi ti theiin mi ring em?” a ti a. Anni chuan a hnênah, “Ring e, Lalpa,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan an mit a dek a, “In rin angin in chungah thleng rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tichuan, an mit chu a lo vâr ta a. Tin, Isuan an hnênah, “Tu ma hriat loh tûrin fîmkhur rawh u,” a ti tlat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Nimahsela, anni chu an chhuak a, chumi ram zawng zawngah chuan a chanchin an tithang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, an chhuah lai takin, ngai teh, ṭawngtheilo, ramhuai man pakhat a hnênah an rawn hruai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tin, ramhuai chu a hnawh chhuah veleh ṭawngtheilo chu a lo ṭawng ta a. Tin, mipuite chuan mak an ti hle a, “Israel-te zîngah hetiang hi an hmu ngai lo,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Pharisaite erawh chuan, “Ramhuai lal avângin a ni ramhuaite a hnawh chhuah ṭhin ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tin, Isua chuan an inkhâwmna inahte zirtîrin, Ram Chanchin Ṭha chu hrilin, damlohna tinrêng leh natna tinrêngte tidamin, khaw lian leh khaw tête zawng zawng a fang zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Chutichuan, mipuite chu a hmuhin, vêngtu nei lo berâmte anga hrehawm leh darha an awm avângin a khawngaih ta êm êm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tichuan, a zirtîrte hnênah chuan, “Buh seng tûr a tam hle si a; nimahsela, a thawktute an tlêm;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />chutichuan, a buh seng tûra thawktu tûrte tîr tûrin buh Neitupa hnênah chuan ngên rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, a zirtîr sâwm leh pahnihte chu a ko va, anmahni hnawh chhuah theihna tûrin ramhuai bawlhhlawhte chunga thuneihna a pe a; damlohna tinrêng leh natna tinrêng tihdam theihna tûrin thuneihna a pe bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, tirhkoh sâwm leh pahnihte hming chu hêng hi a ni: a hmasa berah chuan Simona (Petera an tih) leh a unau Andria te; Zebedaia fapa Jakoba leh a unau Johana te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Philipa leh Bartholomaia te; Thoma leh chhiahkhawntu Matthaia te; Alphaia fapa Jakoba leh Thaddaia te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kanaan-a mi Simona leh a mantîrtu Juda Iskariota te hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chûng sâwm leh pahnihte chu Isuan a tîr chhuak a, an hnênah heti hian thu a pe a: “Jentail-te kawngah kal suh ula, Samari mite khua rêng rêngah pawh lût suh ang che u;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />amaherawhchu, Israel hnam berâm bote hnênah chuan kal zâwk ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, in kalin, ‘Vânram chu a lo hnai ta,’ tiin hril zêl ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Damlote tidam ula, mitthite kai tho ula, phârte tithianghlim ula, ramhuaite hnawt chhuak ang che u; a thlâwnin in hmu a, a thlâwnin pe ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />In kâwnghrênahte chuan rangkachak emaw, tangkarua emaw, dâr emaw keng suh ula;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />zinna atân iptê emaw, kawr pahnih emaw, pheikhawk emaw, tiang emaw keng hek suh u; hnathawktu chu a ei tûr hmu tlâk a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, khaw lianah emaw, khaw têah emaw in luhna apiangah, a thleng tlâk mi tûr che u zawng chhuak ula, in chhuah leh hma loh chuan chutah chuan thleng reng ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, inah chuan in luh dâwnin chibai bûk ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, ina mite chu chibai bûk tlâk an nih chuan, in thlamuanna thu chu an chungah lo thleng rawh se; an tlâk loh erawh chuan, in thlamuanna thu chu in chungah lo kîr leh rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, tu pawh lâwm lo che ua, in thu pawh ngaithla lo apiang, chu in ata emaw, chu khua ata emaw in chhuah hun chuan, in kephaha vaivut chu thing thla ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tihtak meuhvin ka hrilh a che u, ngaihtuah nîah chuan, chumi khuate ai chuan Sodom leh Gomorra ram tuar tûr chu a ziaawm zâwk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ngai teh u, chinghne zînga berâm awm angin ka tirh che u hi; chutichuan, rûl anga finga, ṭhuro anga pawi khawih lovin awm ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nimahsela, mihring lakah chuan fîmkhur rawh u; rorêltuhote an mantîr dâwn si che u a, inkhâwmna inahte an vua ang che u a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />a ni, keimah avângin hotute leh lalte hmaah, anmahni leh Jentail-te hriattîrna tûrin an la hruai ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nimahsela, an mantîr hunah che u chuan, ‘Engtin nge, eng thu nge ka sawi ang?’ tiin lungkham suh ang che u; in sawi tûr chu a hun takah chuan a hriattîr dâwn si che u a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A sawitu chu nangni in ni dâwn si lo va, in Pa Thlarauvin nangmahniah a sawi zâwk dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, tihhlum tûrin unaupa leh unaupa an inmantîr ang a, pa pawhin a fa a mantîr bawk ang; fate pawhin an nu leh an pate an do vang a, an tihhlumtîr bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Keima hming avângin mi zawng zawng huat in ni ang; nimahsela, a tâwp thlenga tuar peih apiang, chu mi ngei chu chhandamin a awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chutichuan, he khuaah hian an tihduhdah hunah che u, khaw dangah tlânsan ang che u; tihtak meuhvin ka hrilh a che u, Mihring Fapa a lo kal hmain Israel khuate chu in fang chhuak lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Zirtîr a zirtîrtu chungah a awm lo; bâwih pawh a pu chungah a awm hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Zirtîr chu a zirtîrtu anga lo awm leh, bâwih chu a pu anga lo awm chu a tâwk e. In neitupa mah ‘Beelzebula’ an tih chuan, a chhûngte chu an va ti nasa dâwn êm!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chutichuan, anmahni chu hlau suh ang che u; lang lo tûra thuhrûk eng mah a awm si lo, hriat loh tûra zêp pawh eng mah a awm hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Thima ka hrilh che u hi êngah sawi ang che u; beng bula in hriat hi in chunga chuangin tlângaupui ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, taksa tihluma thlarau tihlum thei lotute chu hlau suh ula; Gehenna-a thlarau leh taksa tiboral theitu chu hlau zâwk ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Chawngzawng pahnih dâr tangka pakhatah an hralh ṭhîn lo vem ni? Nimahsela, an zînga pakhat mah in Pa lovin leiah a tla lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />In samzaite lam pawh hi chhiar vek a ni asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chuvângin, hlau suh u; chawngzawng tam tak aiin in hlu zâwk si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Chutichuan, mite hmaa mi ṭan apiang, ka Pa vâna mi hmaah ka ṭan ve ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Nimahsela, tu pawh mite hmaa mi phat apiang, ka Pa vâna mi hmaah ka phat ve ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Khawvêlah hian rem lêntîr tûra lo kal emaw min ti suh u; rem lêntîr tûra lo kal ka ni lo va, khandaih lêntîr tûra lo kal ka ni zâwk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Mi a pa dotîr tûrin, fanu a nu dotîr tûrin, mo a pi dotîr tûrin lo kal ka ni asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Mi a hmêlmate chu ama chhûngte zînga mi ngei an ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tu pawh a nu emaw, a pa emaw keimah aia hmangaih zâwk chu ka mi ni tlâk a ni lo; tu pawh a fanu emaw, a fapa emaw keimah aia hmangaih zâwk pawh ka mi ni tlâk a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tu pawh a kraws pua mi zui lo chu ka mi ni tlâk a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tu pawh a nunna hmu chuan a chân ang a; keimah avânga a nunna chân chuan a hmu ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tu pawh a lâwm che u chu mi lâwm a ni a, tu pawh mi lâwm chu mi tîrtu lâwm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tu pawh zâwlnei chu zâwlnei a nih avânga lâwm chuan zâwlnei lâwmman a hmu ang a; tu pawh mi fel chu mi fel a nih avânga lâwm chuan mi fel lâwmman a hmu ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tin, tu pawh hêng mi tê tak zînga pakhat hnênah hian, zirtîr a nih avânga tui vâwt no khat chauh pawh pe apiang chuan, tihtak meuhvin ka hrilh a che u, an lâwmman chu an chân tawp lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, Isuan a zirtîr sâwm leh pahnihte chu thu a pêk zawh veleh, chuta ṭang chuan an khuaahte zirtîr leh thu hril tûrin a kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Johanan Krista thiltihte chu tân inah chuan a lo hriatin, a hnênah, “Lo kal tûra chu i ni nge, mi dang kan la ngai ang?” tiin a zirtîrte a palaitîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Isuan an hnênah, “Kal leh ta ulang, thil in hmuh leh in hriat hi Johana hnênah va hrilh rawh u;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />mitdelte an mit a lo vâr ta, kebaite kein an lo kal ta, phârte an lo thianghlim ta, bengngawngte pawh an beng a lo vâr ta, mitthite pawh kaihthawhin an awm ta, pachhiate pawhin Chanchin ṭha hril an dawng ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, tu pawh ka chunga lungnih lohna hmu lo chu an eng a thâwl e,” tiin a lo chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chûng mite chu an hâwn veleh, Isuan mipui hnênah chuan Johana thu a sawi ta a, “Eng en tûrin nge thlalêra in kal chhuah kha? Luang, thli chhêm nghîn maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A nih loh leh, eng en tûr berin nge in kal chhuah kha? Puan nêm sin maw? Ngai rawh u, puan nêm sinte chu lal inahte asin an awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A nih loh leh eng vâng berin nge in kal chhuah kha? Zâwlnei en tûrin maw? A nih ngei kha, ka ti a che u, zâwlnei ai pawha ropui zâwk,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />‘En teh, ka tirhkoh i hmaan ka tîr a ni, ani chuan i hmaah i kawng a siam ang!’ tia a chanchin an ziak kha he mi hi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tihtak meuhvin ka ti a che u, hmeichhe hrin zîngah Baptistu Johana aia ropui zâwk an la chhuak ngai lo; nimahsela, vânrama mi tê deuh pawh ani ai chuan an ropui zâwk si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Baptistu Johana awm achin tûn thlengin vânram chuan beih vakna a tâwk ṭhîn a, a bei vakte chuan an pâwng lâk ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Zâwlneite zawng zawng leh dân thu chuan, Johana a lo awm thleng khân an hril lâwk ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />In âwih duh zawngin, chu chu Elija, lo kal tûra chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tu pawh hriatna tûra beng nei chuan hre rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nimahsela, tûnlai chhuante hi eng nên nge ka tehkhin ang? Naupang, dâwr hmunahte ṭhua, an ṭhiante auva,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />‘Phênglâwng kan tumsak che u a, in lâm si lo va; Kan ṭap vak a, âwm in inchûm si lo,’ tiate ang hi an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Johana chu a lo kal a, a eiin a in lo va, ‘Ramhuai a zâwl a nih hi,’ an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mihring Fapa a lo kal a, a eiin a in a, ‘En teh u, chaw heh mi, uain heh mi, chhiahkhawntute leh mi sualte ṭhian saw!’ an ti si a. Nimahsela, Finna chu a thiltih aṭangin a dikzia a lang a ni.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, an sim loh avângin, a thilmak tih tamna ber khuate chu a hau ta a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Korazin, i chung a pik e! Bethsaida, i chung a pik e! Nangmahnia thilmak tak tihte kha Tura leh Sidon khuaa tih ni sela, saiip puan sina vut zînga ṭhuin an sim tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nimahsela, ka ti a che u, ngaihtuah nîah chuan nangni tuar ai chuan Tura leh Sidon khaw tuar tûr chu a ziaawm zâwk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, nang Kapernaum, vân thlengin chawimawi i ni dâwn em ni? Mitthi khaw thlengin i zuk kal dâwn asin; nangmaha thilmak tak tihte kha Sodom khuaa tih ni sela, tûn thlengin a la awm reng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nimahsela, ka ti a che u, ngaihtuah nîah chuan, i tuar ai chuan Sodom ram tuar tûr chu a ziaawm zâwk ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Chumi lai chuan Isuan a bia a, “Aw ka Pa, lei leh vân Lalpa, nangin mi fing leh mi bengvârte hnênah hêng thu hi i zêpa, nausênte hnêna i puan avâng hian ka fak a che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A ni, ka Pa, chutiang tih chu i ngaihin a ṭha a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ka Pain thil engkim mi kawltîr tawh; Pa lo chuan tu mahin Fapa hi an hre lo; Fapa leh an hnêna Fapain a puan duhnate chauh lo chuan tu mân Pa chu an hre hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Nangni thawk rim leh phurrit phur zawng zawngte u, ka hnênah lo kal ula, keiman ka chawlhtîr ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ka nghâwngkawl bât ula, ka hnênah zir rawh u; thuhnuairawlh leh rilrua inngaitlâwm tak ka nih hi; tichuan, in thlarau tân chawlhna in hmu ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ka nghâwngkawl chu a nuam a, ka phur pawh a zâng a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chumi lai chuan Isua chu Chawlhniah buh hmunahte a kal tlang a; a zirtîrte chu an ril a ṭâm a, buh vuite an thliak a, an ei ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Pharisaiten chu chu an hmuhin, a hnênah, “En teh, i zirtîrten Chawlhniah tih thiang lo chu an tih hi,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ani erawh chuan an hnênah, “Davida a rilṭâm laia a ṭhiante nêna an thil tih kha in chhiar lo vem ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khatia Pathian ina a luha, amah leh a ṭhiante ei thian loh, puithiamte chauh ei thian chhangdah chu an ei thu kha?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A nih leh, Chawlhnia Pathian biak ina puithiam awmte chuan, Chawlhni an bawrh pawhin an thiam zêl tih dân thûah chuan in chhiar lo vem ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Eng pawh ni sela, Pathian biak in aia ropui zâwk hetah a awm tih ka hrilh a che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nimahsela, ‘Inthawina duh lovin khawngaihna ka duh e,’ tih hi a awmzia lo hre tawh ni ula chu, mi thiamte chu thiam loh in chantîr lo tûr.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mihring Fapa hi Chawlhni Lal a ni si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, chuta ṭang chuan a kal a, an inkhâwmna inah a va lût a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, ngai teh, mi pakhat kut zeng a lo awm a. Tin, an hêk theih nân, “Chawlhniin tihdam a thiang em?” tiin Isua an zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan an hnênah, “Nangni zîngah tu pawhin berâm pakhat nei ula, chu chu Chawlhniah khuarkhurumah tla ang sela, tu nge chelhin kai chhuak lo vang che u?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Berâm pakhat ai chuan mihring pakhat chu a va hlu zâwk êm! Chuvângin, Chawlhniah tihṭhat a thiang e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chu veleh, chu mi hnênah chuan, “I kut phar rawh,” a ti a. Tichuan, a phar a, a lehlam angin a dam ta viah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chutichuan, Pharisaite chu an chhuak a, amah an tihboral theih dân tûr ngaihtuahin an inrâwn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nimahsela, Isuan chu chu a hriatin chuta ṭang chuan a kal bo ta a. Tin, mi tam takin amah an zui a, an zain a lo tidam vek a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />a chanchin puan loh tûr an hnênah a ti tlat a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Zâwlnei Isaian, “En teh, ka chhiahhlawh, ka thlan, Ka duh tak, ka rilruin a lawm êm êma hi; A chungah ka thlarau ka dah ang a, Tichuan, Jentail-te hnênah rorêlna thu a hril ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A hnial lo vang a, a au hek lo vang a, Kawtthlêrahte pawh tu mân a aw an hre hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hneh tûra rorêlna a tirh chhuah hma loh zawng Luang sâwp a titliak fithla lo vang a, La khu pawh a timit lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama hming chu Jentail-te chuan an beisei chhan ang,” tia a sawi kha a lo thlen theihna tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chumi lai chuan, mitdel ṭawngtheilo ramhuai man pakhat a hnênah an rawn hruai a; tin, ani chuan a lo tidam a; chutichuan, ṭawngtheilo chu a lo ṭawng theiin, a lo hmu thei ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, mipuiho zawng zawng chuan mak an ti hle a, “He mi hi Davida fapa chu a ni lâwm ni?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nimahsela, Pharisaiten chu chu an hriat veleh, “He mi hian ramhuai lal Beelzebula avâng lo chuan ramhuaite a hnawt chhuak lo vang,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, Isuan an ngaihtuahte chu a lo hria a, an hnênah, “Khawii ram pawh mahni indo apiang an boral ṭhîn; khawii khua pawh, chhûngkua pawh, mahni indo apiang an ding khawchhuak lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, Setanan Setana vêk a hnawh chhuah chuan mahni indo a ni ang asin; a ram chu engtin nge a din chhuah ang le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, kei Beelzebula avânga ramhuaite hnawt chhuak ṭhîn ka lo nih chuan, in faten tu vângin nge an lo hnawh chhuah ṭhin le? Chuvângin, anni chu nangmahni ngaihtuahtu tûrte an ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, kei hian Pathian Thlarau avânga ramhuaite hnawt chhuak ṭhîn ka nih chuan, Pathian ram in hnênah a lo thleng tawh a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Chuti a nih si loh chuan, miin mi chak chu a phuar hmasak zet loh chuan, engtin nge mi chak ina lûtin a sum a lâksak theih ang? Chumi hnuah erawh chuan a in chu a ramsak mai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tu pawh ka lama ṭang lo chu mi do a ni; tu pawh mi lâk khâwmpui lo chuan a tidarh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chuvângin, ka ti a che u, mi an sualna tinrêngah leh Pathian an sawichhiatna tinrêngah chuan ngaihdamsak an ni ang a; Thlarau meuh sawichhiatna erawh chu ngaihdamsak a ni lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, tu pawh Mihring Fapa sawisêl apiang chu, an sawisêlna chu ngaihdamsak a ni ang a; tu pawh Thlarau Thianghlim meuh sawisêl apiang erawh chu, an sawisêlna chu tûn dam chhûngah pawh, hun lo la thleng tûrah pawh ngaihdamsak a ni lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Thing chu a ṭha, a rah pawh a ṭha, in tih loh vêk leh, thing chu a chhia, a rah pawh a chhia, ti law law rawh u; thing chu a rahah a hriat si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Rûl thlahte u, nangnin sual reng chungin engtin nge thu ṭha in sawi theih ang? Thinlunga khat liam chu kain a sawi ṭhîn asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Mi ṭha chuan a ro bâwm ṭha ata thil ṭhate a theh chhuak ṭhîn a, mi sual chuan a ro bâwm chhia ata thil chhiate a theh chhuak ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tin, ka hrilh a che u, miten thu lawi lo an sawi apiang, chûng thu chu rorêl nîah chuan an sawi fiah a la ṭûl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />I thu chuan thiam a chantîr ang chia, i thu vêk chuan thiam loh a chantîr bawk dâwn che asin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Chumi lai chuan lehkhaziaktute leh Pharisaite zînga mi tuten emaw an bia a, a hnênah, “Zirtîrtu, i hnên ata chhinchhiahna hmuh kan duh e,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Ani erawh chuan an hnênah, “Chhuan sual tak leh uire hmang takte chuan chhinchhiahna an zawng a; nimahsela, zâwlnei Jona chhinchhiahna chauh lo chu an hnênah chhinchhiahna rêng rêng pêk a ni lo vang:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Jona chu ni thum leh zan thum nghapui kawchhûnga a awm ang khân, Mihring Fapa hi ni thum leh zan thum lei kawchhûngah a awm bawk dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Ninevi khuaa mite chu ngaihtuah hunah chuan, tûnlai chhuante hnênah hian an ding ve ang a, thiam loh an chantîr ang, Jona thuhril avângin an sim si a; ngai teh u, Jona aia ropui zâwk hetah hian a awm asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Chhim lam lalnu kha ngaihtuah hunah chuan, tûnlai chhuante hnênah hian a tho ve ang a, thiam loh a chantîr ang; Solomona fin ngaithla tûr mahin kâwlkil ata a lo kal si a; ngai teh u, Solomona aia ropui zâwk hetah hian a awm asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tin, ramhuai bawlhhlawh chu mi kawchhûng ata a chhuahin, chawlhna zawngin tui awm lohna hmunahte a vâk a vâk a, a hmu ṭhîn si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tin, ‘Ka chhuahna inah khân ka kîr leh mai ang,’ a ti a; tin, a va thlen chuan, in chu ruaka, phiah faia, chei mawiin a hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Chu veleh a va kal a, amah aia sual zâwk ramhuai dang pasarih a hruai a, chutah chuan an lût a, an awm reng ṭhîn a; chu mihringa awmze hnuhnûng chu a hmasa aiin a lo ṭha lo zâwk ṭhîn a ni. Chutiang bawkin tûnlai chhuan sual takte chungah hian a la awm ang,” tiin a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Mipuite hnêna thu a la sawi lai chuan, ngai teh, a nu leh a unaute chu amah biak tumin pâwnah an ding a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Tin, mi pakhatin a hnênah, “Ngai teh, i nu leh i unaute biak tum chein pâwnah sâwn an ding reng e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Ani erawh chuan a hrilhtu hnênah chuan, “Ka nu chu tu nge ni? Ka unaute pawh chu tute nge ni?” tiin a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Tin, a zirtîrte lamah a kut a phar a, “En teh u, ka nu leh ka unaute hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Tu pawh ka Pa vâna mi duh zâwng ti apiang chu ka unau te, ka farnu te, ka nu te an ni asin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chumi ni chuan Isua chu in ata a kal chhuak a, dîl kamah chuan a ṭhu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, a hnênah mipui tam tak an rawn inkhâwm a; chutichuan, lawngah a chuang a, a ṭhu a; mipui zawng zawng chu ṭiauphovah an ding a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, tehkhin thuin thu tam tak an hnênah a sawi a: “Ngai teh u, buh chi thehtu buh chi thehin a feh a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />tin, a theh laiin a ṭhen kawng dungah a tla a, savaten an rawn tlân zo ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, a ṭhen pialtlêp lei pan hmunah a tla a; lei a chhah loh avângin a ṭo ta nghâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nimahsela, ni a lo tlângsân deuhvin em vuaiin a lo awm a, zung a neih loh avângin a râwp ta mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, a ṭhen hnimhlîngnei zîngah a tla a, hnim chu a lo ṭo sâng a, a dîp ral ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, a ṭhen lei ṭhaah a tla a, ṭhenkhat a leh za te, ṭhenkhat a leh sawmruk te, ṭhenkhat a leh sawmthum tein a lo rah ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tu pawh beng nei chuan hre rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, zirtîrte chu an lo kal a, a hnênah, “Engati nge an hnênah tehkhin thuin i sawi?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan a chhâng a, an hnênah, “Vânram thurûk chu nangni hriat zawng phal a ni a, anni hriat erawh chu phal a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tu pawh a nei apiang an pêk belhchhah ang a, an nei ṭeuh vang; nimahsela, tu pawh a nei lo apiang chu, an neih chhun pawh an lâksak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chutih avâng chuan tehkhin thuin an hnênah ka sawi a ni; hmu mah sela an hmuh ṭhin lohva, bengin hre mah sela an hriat ṭhin lohva, a ngaihna pawh an hriat ṭhin loh avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Isaia thu sawi lâwk kha an chungah a lo thleng a nih hi: ‘Beng zawngin in hre na ang a, A ngaihna erawh chu in hre tawp lo vang; Hmuh zawng in hmu na ang a, Hriat erawh chu in hre tawp lo vang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />He chite thinlung hi a lo chawlawl ta a, An bengte a lo ngawng deuh va, An maimitchhîng bawk a; Chuti lo chuan, kan mitin kan hmu ang a, Kan bengin kan hria ang a, Kan thinlungin kan hre bawk ang a, Kan hawi kîr leh ang a, Anin min tidam hlauh dah ang e, an ti a,’ a tih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nangni mit erawh chu a vânnei a ni, a hmuh ṭhin avângin; in beng pawh a vânnei a ni, a hriat ṭhin avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tihtak meuhvin ka hrilh a che u, zâwlnei tam takte leh mi fel tam takte pawhin in thil hmuhte hi hmuh an châk a; nimahsela, an hmu si lo; in thil hriatte pawh hi hriat an châk a; nimahsela, an hre si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chutichuan, buh chi thehtu tehkhin thu chu hre rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tu pawhin ram thu chu benga a lo hriata, a ngaihna a hriat si loh chuanin, mi sual chu a lo kal a, a thinlunga theh sa chu a chhuhsak ṭhîn. Chu mi chu kawng dunga theh chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, pialtlêp hmuna theh chu, thu chu hriaa lâwm taka pawm nghâl ṭhîn hi a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />nimahsela, amahah chuan zung a awm lo va, rei lo tê chauh a awm a; tin, thu avâng chuan hrehawmna emaw, tihduhdahna emaw a lo awm veleh a tlu nghâl mai ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, hnimhlîngnei zînga theh chu, thu hretu a ni a; nimahsela, khawvêl lungkhamna leh hausakna bumna chuan thu chu a dîp a, rah lovin a lo awm ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, lei ṭhaa theh chu, thu chu benga hriaa a ngaihna hre bawk hi a ni; chu mi chu a rah ngei a, ṭhenkhat a leh za te, ṭhenkhat a leh sawmruk te, ṭhenkhat a leh sawmthum tein a pung ṭhîn,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tehkhin thu dang an hnênah a sawi leh a: “Vânram chu, mi a lova chi ṭha thehtu nên chuan tehkhin a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />nimahsela, mi an muthilh hlânin a hmêlma a lo kal a, buh zîngah chuan buh lem a theh a, a kal bo leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, buh chu a lo ṭo va, a lo vuih chuan buh lem chu a lo lang ve ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, in neitu bâwihte chu an lo kal a, a hnênah chuan, ‘Ka pu, i lovah chi ṭha i theh lo vem ni? Buh lem saw khawi ata lo awm nge ni le?’ an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan an hnênah, ‘Chu chu hmêlmain a lo ti ta a nih chu,’ a ti a. Tin, bâwihte chuan a hnênah, ‘A nih leh chûng chu va la khâwm mai ila rem i ti em?’ an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ani erawh chuan, ‘Remti lo ve; buh lem chu in lâk khâwm zâwngin buh chu in pawt tel hlauh dah ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Buh seng thlengin ṭo za rawh se; tin, buh seng hunah chuan buh âttute hnênah, buh lem chu la khâwm hmasa zet ula, hâl tûrin têl rawh u; buh erawh chu ka buh inah seng lût rawh u, ka la ti ang e,’ a ti a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tehkhin thu dang an hnênah a sawi leh a: “Vânram chu anṭam chi fang khat miin a lâka, a lova a theh ang chu a ni a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />chu chu chi zawng zawng aiin a tê ber a; nimahsela, a lo ṭo sân hunah chuan thlaite ai chuan a lian zâwk a, thing a lo ni ṭhîn a; chutichuan, chunglêng savate chu an lo kal a, a zârahte chuan an riak ṭhîn a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tehkhin thu dang an hnênah a sawi leh a: “Vânram chu, dawidim hmeichhiain a lâka, chhangphut tehkhâwng thum zîngah a zaa a thawh vek thlenga a phûma ang chu a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Chûng zawng chu Isuan tehkhin thuin mipuite hnênah a sawi a, tehkhin thu lovin an hnênah eng mah a sawi lo:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />zâwlneiin, “Tehkhin thuin ka kâ ka âng ang a, Leilung pian tirh ata thil inthup chu ka sawi chhuak ang,” tia a sawi kha a lo thlen theihna tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Chumi lai chuan mipuite chu a kalsan a, inah chuan a lût ta a; tin, a zirtîrte chu a hnênah an lo kal a, “Lova buh lem tehkhin thu kha min hrilhfiah rawh,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan a chhâng a, “Chi ṭha thehtu chu Mihring Fapa hi a ni a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />lo chu khawvêl hi a ni a; chi ṭhate chu ram fate an ni a; buh lemte chu mi sual fate an ni a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />hmêlma, a thehtu chu Diabola a ni a; buh seng chu khawvêl tâwpna tûr a ni; buh âttute chu vântirhkohte an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Chutichuan, buh lemte chu an la khâwm a, meiin an hâl ang hian khawvêl tâwpnaah chuan a la awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Mihring Fapa hian a vântirhkohte chu a tîr chhuak ang a, a ram ata tihsualtîrtute leh thil tisualtute zawng zawng chu an thiar chhuak ang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />rawh tuina meiah chuan an paih ang; chutah chuan ṭah leh ha ṭhial chu a awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Chumi hunah chuan mi felte chu an Pa ramah chuan ni angin an êng tawh ang. Beng nei chuan hre rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Vânram chu lova ro phûm rûk ang a ni; chu chu miin a hmu a, a thukru a; a lâwm avângin a neih zawng zawng chu a va hralh a, chu lo chu a lei ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tin, vânram chu sumdâwng mi, tuikeplung ṭha tak zawngtu ang chu a ni leh a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />tin, ani chuan tuikeplung hlu tak pakhat a hmu a, a neih zawng zawng chu a va hralh a, a lei ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Tin, vânram chu lênkhang, tuifinriata dena, chi tinrêng fûn khâwmna ang chu a ni leh pek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Chu chu a khah veleh a kamah an hnûk chhuak a; tin, an ṭhu a, a ṭha zawng chu bâwmah an la khâwm a, a chhia erawh chu an paih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Khawvêl tâwp hunah chuan chutiang bawkin a awm ang; vântirhkohte chu an lo chhuak ang a, mi fel zîng ata mi sualte chu an hlîr ang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />rawh tuina meiah chuan an paih ang; chutah chuan ṭah leh ha ṭhial chu a awm ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Isua vêkin an hnênah, “Chûng zawng zawng chu in hria em?” a ti a. Anni chuan a hnênah, “Hria e,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan an hnênah, “Chuti a nih chuan, lehkhaziaktu vânram kawng zirtîra awm apiang chu, in neitu, a ro bâwm ata thil tharte leh thil hluite phawrh chhuak ṭhîntu ang chu a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, Isua chu chûng tehkhin thute a sawi zawh veleh chuan chuta ṭang chuan a kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Tin, a awmna khaw lam chu a thleng a, an inkhâwmna inah chuan anmahni a zirtîr ta a; chutichuan, mak an ti hle a, “He mi hian he finna leh hêng thilmak tih theihnate hi khawi ata nge a hmuh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />He mi hi thingrem siamtu fapa kha a ni lo vem ni? A nu chu Mari an tih hi a ni lo vem ni? A unaute pawh Jakoba, Josefa, Simona, Juda an tihte chu an ni lo vem ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />A farnute pawh kan hnêna awm an ni vek lo vem ni? He mi hian khawi ata tehlul nge hêng zawng zawng hi a hmuh ni?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Tichuan, a chungah an lungni ta lo va. Nimahsela, Isuan an hnênah, “Zâwlnei chu ama khaw lamah leh ama inah chauh lo chuan chawimawi lohvin a awm ngai lo,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Tin, an rin loh avângin chutah chuan thilmak tam a ti lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chumi lai tak chuan Lal Heroda chuan Isua chanchin chu a lo hria a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />a chhiahhlawhte hnênah, “Chu chu Baptistu Johana kha a nih chu; mitthi zîng ata a tho leh ta zuk nia; chuvângin, chûng thiltihtheihnate chuan amahah a thawk a nih chu,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Heroda chuan a unau Philipa nupui Herodi avângin Johana chu a man a, a phuar a, tân inah a lo khung tawh a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Johana chuan a hnênah, “Ani i neih hi a thiang lo ve,” a tihsak avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Johana chu tihhlum a tumin mipui a hlau va, zâwlneia an ruat avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nimahsela, Heroda pian champhaphâk ni chu a lo thlenin Herodi fanu chu a laiah a lâm a, Heroda chu a tilâwm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chumi avâng chuan a dîl apiang pe tûrin chhechhamin a tiam ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan a nu fuihin, “Hetah hian thlêngin Baptistu Johana lû mi pe rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, lal chu a lungngai ta a; nimahsela, a thutiamte leh a chaw kîlpuite avâng chuan pêk tûr thu a pe a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />tichuan, mi a tîr a, tân ina Johana lû chu a tantîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, a lû chu thlêngin an rawn la a, hmeichhe naupang hnênah chuan an pe a; ani chuan a nu hnênah a kalpui ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, zirtîrte chuan a ruang chu an va hlâwm a, an phûm a; tin, Isua an va hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Isuan chu chu a hriatin, chuta ta chu lawngin thlalêr hmunah a kal hrang ta a. Nimahsela, mipuite chuan an hriat veleh khua aṭangte chuan kea kalin an zui ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tichuan, ani chu vaukama a chhuah chuan mipui tam tak a hmu a, a khawngaih êm êm a, an damlote a tidam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, tlai lam a lo nihin zirtîrte chu a hnênah an lo kal a, “Hei hi thlalêr hmun a ni a, khua pawh a lo tlai ta si a; khuaahte kalin an tân ei tûr an lei theihna tûrin mipuite hi kaltîr ta che,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Isua erawh chuan an hnênah, “An kal bo a ngai lo ve; nangmahnin ei tûr pe rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, anni chuan a hnênah, “Hetah chhangpêr panga leh sangha pahnih chauh kan nei a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “Hetah ka hnênah han la rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, hlobet chunga ṭhu tûrin mipuite chu thu a pe a, chhangpêr panga leh sangha pahnih chu a la a, vân lam enin mal a sâwm a, a phel a, chhangpêrte chu zirtîrte hnênah a pe a; tin, zirtîrte chuan mipuite hnênah an pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, an vaiin an ei a, an puar ta hlawm a; an ei bângnawi pawh chu bâwmrâng sâwm leh pahnih an rût khat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A eitute chu, hmeichhia leh naupang tiam lovin, patling hlîr pawh sângnga lai an ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, mipuite chu a ṭîntîr vêl chhûngin, a kal hmaa râl lehlama lo kal hmasa tûrin zirtîrte chu lawngah a chuan luihtîr ta nghâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, mipuite chu a ṭîntîr hnuin, ṭawngtai tûrin tlângah chuan a han kal hrang a; tin, tlai lam a lo nihin chutah chuan amah chauhvin a awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Lawng erawh chu dîl lai takah a awm tawh a; thliin a ni lo zâwnga a nem avângin tuifâwnin a vawrh a vawrh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, khawfîng chah dawn laiin, dîl chungah kea kalin an hnên lam a rawn pan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, zirtîrte chuan amah chu dîl chunga kea a kal an han hmuh chuan, “Hmuithla a nih saw!” tiin an thlaphâng a, hlauvin an au ta vak mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Nimahsela, Isuan anmahni a be ta nghâl a, “Thlamuang takin awm rawh u; keimah ka ni alâwm; hlau suh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, Peteran a chhâng a, “Lalpa, nang i nih chuan tui chunga i hnêna lo kal thu mi pe rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “Lo kal ta che,” a ti a. Petera chu lawng ata a chhuk a, Isua hnên lam panin tui chungah chuan kein a kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Nimahsela, thli tleh chu a hmuhin a hlau va, a pil dâwn ta mai a, “Lalpa, min chhandam rawh,” tiin a au ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, Isuan a ban ta nghâl a, amah chu a chelh a, a hnênah, “Nang, rin tlêm, engah nge i rinhlelh le?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, lawnga an chuan chuan thli chu a bâng ta mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tin, lawnga awmte chuan, “Pathian Fapa i lo nih tak zet hi,” tiin amah chibai an bûk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tin, râl lehlam an kai chuan Gennesaret ram khawmual an thleng ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tin, chumi hmuna mite chuan amah an hriat veleh, chumi kiang vêl ram zawng zawngah chuan mi an tîr a, damlo zawng zawng chu a hnênah an rawn hruai a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />tin, a puan hmâwr tal deh theih an dîl chiam a; tin, a dek apiang chu an lo dam ta zêl a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chumi lai chuan, Jerusalem khua aṭangin Pharisaite leh lehkhaziaktute Isua hnênah an lo kal a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Engati nge i zirtîrten upate thurochhiah chu an bawhchhiat ṭhin? Chhang an eiin an kut an sil ngai si lo va,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan an hnênah, “Nangni pawhin engati nge in thurochhiah avânga Pathian thupêk in bawhchhiat ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pathianin, ‘I nu leh i pa chawimawi rawh,’ ‘Tu pawh a nu emaw, a pa emaw sawi chhia apiang chu thi mawlh rawh se,’ a ti si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nangni erawh chuan, ‘Tu pawh a nu emaw, a pa emaw hnêna, “I mi chhawrna tûr hi Pathian hnêna pêk a ni tawh,” ti apiang chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />a nu leh a pa a chawimawi tûr a ni lo ve,’ in ti ṭhîn a. Tichuan, in thurochhiah avângin Pathian thu chu in bawh bo ta a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Vervêkte u, Isaia hian in chungchâng thu a lo hril lâwk dik zet mai,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />‘He miteho hian an kâin mi chawimawi a, An thinlung erawh chuan mi hlat si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Eng pawh ni sela, an zirtîrnaah mihring thupêk an zirtîr avângin an mi biak ṭhin hi a thlâwn mai a ni,’ tiin,” a ti a, a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, mipui chu a ko va, an hnênah, “Ngaithla ula, lo ngai thiam rawh u:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />kâa lût chu mihring tibawlhhlawhtu a ni lo va; kâa chhuak chu, chu ngei chu mihring tibawlhhlawhtu a ni zâwk e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chumi lai chuan a zirtîrte an lo kal a, a hnênah, “Pharisaiten kha thu kha an hriata an lungnih loh kha i hria em?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ani erawh chuan, “Kûng zawng zawng ka Pa vâna mi phun loh chu pawh chhuahin a awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Anni chu pawisa suh u; hruaitu mitdel an ni. Tichuan, mitdelin mitdel vêk a hruai chuan khuarkhurumah an tla dûn ang,” a ti a, a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Peteran a hnênah, “Tehkhin thu kha min hrilhfiah ta che,” tiin a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “Tûn thlengin nangni pawh hriatna nei lovin in la awm cheu maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kâa lût apiang chu pumah a tla thla a, dailênnaa paih chhuahin a awm tih in hre lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kâa chhuakte erawh chu thinlung aṭanga lo chhuak a ni; chûng ngei chuan mihring a tibawlhhlawh ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Thinlung aṭang hian ngaihtuahna sualte, tualthahnate, uirênate, inngaihnate, rûkrûknate, hêknate, sawichhiatnate a lo chhuak si ṭhîn a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chûng chu mihring tibawlhhlawhtu a ni; kut sil lova chaw ei erawh chuan mi a tibawlhhlawh lo ve,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, Isua chu chuta ta chu a chhuak a, Tura leh Sidon bialah a kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, ngai teh, chûng ram ata chu Kanaan hmeichhe pakhat a lo chhuak a, “Lalpa, Davida Fapa, mi khawngaih rawh; ka fanu ramhuaiin a man tlat a ni,” tiin a au va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ani erawh chuan kam khat mahin a chhâng lo. Tin, a zirtîrte chuan, “Kan hnungah a au a au si a, kaltîr mai ta che,” tiin an rawn ngên a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ani erawh chuan, “Israel hnam berâm bo hnênah lo chuan tirh ka ni lo ve,” a ti a, a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nimahsela, hmeichhia chu a lo kal a, “Lalpa, mi pui rawh a!” tiin chibai a bûk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “Fate chhang lâksaka, uite hnêna paih chu a mawi lo ve,” a ti a, a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Lalpa, nih zawng a ni a; nimahsela, uite pawhin an pu dawhkân ata chhang nawi tla chu an ei ṭhîn alâwm,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chu veleh Isua chuan a hnênah, “Hmeichhia, i rin a nasa êm mai; i duh ang takin i chungah awm rawh se” a ti a, a chhâng a. Tichuan, a fanu chu chumi achinah chuan a lo dam ta mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, Isua chu chuta ta chu a kal a, Galili dîl kiang a thleng a; tin, tlângah chuan a chho va, chutah chuan a ṭhu ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, mipui tam tak, kebaite, mitdelte, ṭawngtheilote, piangsualte rawn hruaiin a hnênah an lo kal a, a ke bulah an dah a; tin, a lo tidam ta hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chutichuan, mipui chuan ṭawngtheilote chu lo ṭawnga, piangsualte chu lo ṭhaa, kebaite chu kea kala, mitdelte chu hmu theia an hmuhin mak an ti hle a; tichuan, Israel-te Pathian chu an fak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, Isuan a zirtîrte chu a ko va, “Mipuiho hi tûnah ni thum ka hnênah an awm tawh a, ei tûr eng mah an neih loh avângin ka khawngaih êm êm a ni; chaw ngheiin ka kaltîr duh lo ve; chuti lo chuan, kawng lakah an chau dah ang e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tin, zirtîrte chuan a hnênah, “Mipui heti zozai puarna khawp chhangpêr chuti zozai thlalêrah khawi ata nge kan hmuh ang?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tin, Isuan an hnênah, “Chhangpêr eng zât nge in neih?” a ti a. Tin, anni chuan “Pêr sarih, nghatê tlêm tê nên,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan leia ṭhu tûrin mipui chu thu a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tin, chhangpêr pasarih leh sanghate chu a la a, lâwmthu a sawi a, a phel a, zirtîrte hnênah a pe a; tin, zirtîrte chuan mipuite hnênah an pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tin, an vaiin an ei a, an puar ta hlawm a; an ei bângnawi pawh chu bâwm sarih an rût khat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />A eitute chu, hmeichhia leh naupang tiam lovin, patling hlîr pawh sângli an ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tin, mipuite chu a ṭintîr hnuin lawngah a chuang a, Magadan ram a lo thleng a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Pharisaite leh Saddukaite an lo kal a, amah fiah nân vân ata chhinchhiahna anmahni entîr tûrin an dîl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nimahsela, ani chuan an hnênah, “Tlai lam a lo nihin, ‘Khua a ṭha dâwn a ni ang, kâwl a sen êm mai,’ in ti ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, zîngah chuan, ‘Vawiin chu khua a chhe dâwn a ni ang, kâwl a sen a, khua a dûr êm mai,’ in ti ṭhîn a. Vân awmzia in hre fiah thiam si a; nimahsela, hun chhinchhiahnate hi in hre fiah thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chhuan sual tak leh uire hmang takte chuan chhinchhiahna an zawng a; nimahsela, Jona chhinchhiahna chauh lo chu an hnênah chhinchhiahna rêng rêng pêk a ni lo vang,” a ti a, a chhâng a. Tin, anmahni chu a kalsan a, a kal ta daih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, zirtîrte chu râl lehlam an thlen chuan chhang an lo ken theihnghilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Isuan an hnênah, “Pharisaite leh Saddukaite dawidim lakah chuan invêng ula, fîmkhur rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, anni chu, “Chhang kan keng hauh lo,” tiin an inngaihtuah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Isuan chu chu a hria a, “Rin tlêmte u, engati nge chhang in neih loh avânga in inngaihtuah ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tûnah pawh in rilruin in la hre lo fo maw? Mi sângnga chhangpêr pangaa hrai leh, in bâwmrâng ruh khah zât kha in hre reng lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mi sângli chhangpêr pasariha hraia in bâwm ruh khah zât pawh kha?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chhang thu in hnênah ka sawi lo tih eng tizia nge in hriat loh? Pharisaite leh Saddukaite dawidim lakah erawh chuan fîmkhur rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chu veleh chhang dawidim lakah fîmkhur tûrin a tîr lo va, Pharisaite leh Saddukaite zirtîrna laka fîmkhur tûrin anmahni a tîr zâwk tih an lo hre ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Isua chu Kaisara Philippi bial a lo thlen chuan, a zirtîrte hnênah, “Miten Mihring Fapa hi tu nge a ni an tih?” tiin a zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, anni chuan, “Ṭhenkhatin, ‘Baptistu Johana a ni,’ an ti a; ṭhenkhatin, ‘Elija a ni,’ an ti; ṭhenkhatin ‘Jeremia emaw, zâwlnei tua emaw a ni,’ an ti,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ani chuan an hnênah, “A nih leh, nangnin tu nge a ni mi tih?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Simon Peteran, “Krista, Pathian nung Fapa chu i ni,” a ti a, a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, Isuan a hnênah, “Simon Bar-jona, i eng a thâwl e; tisa leh thisenin a hriattîr che a ni si lo va, ka Pa vâna miin a hriattîr zâwk che a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, nang Petera i ni tih ka hrilh bawk a che; he lungpui chungah hian ka kohhranho ka rem chho vang a, Mitthi Khaw kulh kawngkhârte chuan chu chu an ngam lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Vânram chabite ka pe ang chia, lei chungah eng pawh i phuar apiang vânah phuar a ni ang a; lei chungah eng pawh i phelh apiang vânah phelh a ni ang,” a ti a, a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chumi zawhah Krista a ni tih tu mah hrilh lo tûrin zirtîrte chu a ti tlat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chumi achinah chuan Isuan Jerusalem khuaa a kal tûrzia te, upate, puithiam lalte, lehkhaziaktute laka thil tam tak a tuar tûrzia te, tihhluma a awm tûrzia te, ni thum nia kaihthawha a awm tûrzia te chu a zirtîrte a hriattîr ṭan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, Petera chuan ani chu a hruai hrang a, “Lalpa, Pathianin khawngaih che rawh se; chûng chu i chungah a thleng tawp lo vang,” tiin a zilh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ani erawh chu a hawi a, Petera hnênah chuan, “Setan, ka hnungah kal rawh; ka tân tlûkna i ni e; Pathian thilte ngaihtuah lovin, mihring thilte i ngaihtuah zâwk a nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, Isuan a zirtîrte hnênah, “Tu pawhin mi zui a duh chuan, mahni hrehawm pawisa lovin, a kraws puin mi zui rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tu pawh a nun humhim duh apiangin a chân ang a; tu pawh keimah avânga a nun chân apiangin a humhim ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Miin khawvêl hi a pumin nei sela, a nun chân si sela, a tân eng nge sâwt ang? A nih loh leh, miin a nun aiah eng nge a pêk ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mihring Fapa hi a vântirhkohte nên, a Pa ropuinaa inthuamin a lo kal dâwn si a; chumi hunah chuan mi tin an thiltih ang zêlin a rûl ṭheuh vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tihtak meuhvin ka ti a che u, heta dingho a ṭhente hi, Mihring Fapa a rama lo kal an hmuh hma loh chuan, thihna tem tawp lo tûr an awm,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, ni ruk achinah chuan Isuan Petera te, Jakoba te, a unau Johana te a hruai a, a hrangin tlâng sâng takah a kal chhohpui a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />an hmaah chuan a hmêl awmzia chu a lo danglam ta a; a hmai chu ni angin a lo êng a, a silhfênte chu êng angin a lo vâr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, ngai teh, Mosia leh Elija chu amah nên inbiain an hnênah an inlâr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Peteran Isua a bia a, “Lalpa, kan tân heta awm hi a ṭha; i duh chuan hetah hian bâwktê pathum ka khawh ang; i tân pakhat, Mosia tân pakhat, Elija tân pakhat,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A la sawi lai mêkin, ngai teh, chhûm vâr takin anmahni a rawn hliah ta a; tin, ngai teh, chhûm aṭang chuan awin, “Hei hi ka Fapa duh tak, ka lawm êm êma chu a ni; ama thu ngai rawh u,” a rawn ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, zirtîrte chuan chu chu an hriatin an tlu bawkkhup a, an hlau ta êm êm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Isuan anni chu a rawn dek a, “Tho ula, hlau suh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, an dâk chhuak a, Isua chauh lo chu tu mah an hmu ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, tlâng ata chu an chhuk laiin, Isuan an hnênah, “Mihring Fapa hi mitthi zîng ata a thawhleh hma loh zawng, in thil hmuh kha tu mah hrilh suh u,” tiin thu a pe ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, a zirtîrte chuan a hnênah, “Lehkhaziaktuten, ‘Elija a lo kal hmasa tûr a ni,’ engtiziaa ti nge an nih le?” tiin an zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “Elija chu a lo kal dâwn rêng a ni, engkim a siam ṭha bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nimahsela, ka hrilh a che u, Elija chu a lo kal tawh reng a ni, amah chu an hre lo va, a chungah an duh duhin an ti ta zâwk a. Chutiang bawkin Mihring Fapa pawh hian an lakah a tuar ve dâwn a ni,” a ti a, a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chu veleh, zirtîrte chuan Baptistu Johana thu an hnênah a sawi a ni tih an lo hre ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, mipui hnên an lo thlenin, mi pakhat a hnênah a lo kal a, a hmaah ṭhingṭhiin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Lalpa, ka fapa saw khawngaih ang che, thlaemât a ni a, a tuar nasa êm mai; vawi tam tak meiah a tlu ṭhîn a, vawi tam tak tuiah a tlu bawk ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, i zirtîrte hnênah ka rawn hruai a, an tidam thei si lo va,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, Isuan, “Chhuan rinna nei lova tihmawhte u, eng chen nge in hnênah ka awm ang a, eng chen nge ka ngaihtheih ang che u? Amah chu ka hnênah hian rawn hruai rawh u,” a ti a, a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, Isuan ramhuai chu a hau va, a chhûng ata a chhuak ta a; chumi dâr achinah chuan naupang chu a lo dam ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chumi hnuah chuan zirtîrte chu a hrangin Isua hnênah an lo kal a, “Engati nge keinin kan hnawh chhuah theih loh?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan an hnênah, “In rin tlêm avângin. Tihtak meuhin ka hrilh a che u, anṭam mu fang khat ang rinna in neih chuan, he tlâng hnênah hian, ‘Heta ṭangin sawtah sâwn va insawn rawh,’ in ti ang a, a insawn mai ang; in tân tih theih loh rêng eng mah a awm lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, Galili rama an rawn inkhâwm laiin, Isuan an hnênah, “Mihring Fapa hi mihringte kutah mantîrin a awm dâwn a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />tin, an tihlum ang a, ni thum nî-ah kaihthawhin a awm ang,” a ti a. Tichuan, an lungngai ta êm êm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, Kapernaum khua chu an thlenin, Pathian biak in tangka khawntute chu Petera hnênah an lo kal a, “In zirtîrtuin biak in tangka chu a pe ve ṭhîn lâwm ni?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Pe ve ṭhîn e,” a ti a. Tin, ina a va luh chuan Isuan a hnênah, “Simon, engtin nge i ngaih? Leia lalten chhiah emaw, sum neih man emaw, tu lakah nge an lâk ṭhin? An fate lakah nge mi hrang lakah?” tiin a lo sawi khalh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, Peteran, “Mi hrang lakah,” a tih veleh, Isuan a hnênah, “Chuti a nih si chuan fate chu an âwl a ni ang chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Nimahsela, nang, dîlah va kal la, nghakuai chiah la, sangha lo chhuak hmasa chu man rawh; tin, a kâ i keu veleh chêng hnih i hmu mai ang; chu chu la la, kei leh nanga tân an hnênah pe rawh; chuti lo chuan, anni chu kan tilungni lo dah ang e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chumi lai tak chuan zirtîrte chu Isua hnênah an lo kal a, “Vânramah tu nge ropui ber ang le?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan naupang tê a ko va, an zîngah a dintîr a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Tihtak meuhin ka ti a che u, in inlamlêta, naupang tê ang in lo nih loh chuan vânramah in lût tawp lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chutichuan, tu pawh he naupang tê anga inngaitlâwm apiang, chu mi chu vânramah chuan a ropui ber ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, tu pawh ka hming avânga hetiang naupang tê pakhat lâwm apiang chu, keimah mi lâwm an ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, tu pawh hêng mi ringtu mi tête zînga pakhat pawh titlu apiang chu, an nghâwngah buh râwt sawmna lung lian pui awrhtîrin, tuifinriat thûk laiah thlâk daih sela an tân a sâwt zâwk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tlûknate avângin khawvêl chung a pik e! Tlûknate chu lo awm tûr rêng zawng a ni a; nimahsela, tlûkna awmtîrtu chung chu a pik e!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, i kutin emaw, i kein emaw a tihtlûk che chuan, tan la, paih daih rawh; kut pahnih emaw, ke pahnih emaw neia kumkhaw meia paih ai chuan, piangsualin emaw, kebaiin emaw nunnaa luh i tân a ṭha zâwk e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, i mitin a tihtlûk che chuan, kher chhuak la, paih daih rawh; mit khing hnih neia Gehenna meia paih ai chuan, mit khing khat neia nunnaa luh i tân a ṭha zâwk e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hêng mi tête zînga pakhat pawh hi hmusit lo tûrin fîmkhur rawh u; an vântirhkohten vânah ka Pa vâna mi hmêl chu an hmu fo ṭhîn tih ka hrilh che u hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Engtin nge in ngaih? Mi tu pawhin berâm za nei sela, an zînga pakhat vâk bo sela, sawmkua leh pakuate chu hnutchhiaha tlânga han kalin, a bo chu a zawng lo vang em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tihtak meuhvin ka hrilh a che u, a hmuh leh hlauh chuan, sawmkua leh pakua vâk bo lote chungah ai chuan a chungah a lâwm zâwk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chutiang bawkin hêng mi tête zînga pakhat boral pawh hi, in Pa vâna mi duh zâwng a ni lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, i unauvin i chungah thil tisual sela, kal la, amah leh nangmah chauhva hriatah a sualnaah chuan zilh ang che; a ngaihthlâk che chuan i unau chu i hneh a ni tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A ngaihthlâk loh che erawh chuan, mi dang pakhat emaw, pahnih emaw i hnênah hruai ang che; chutichuan, thu tinrêng chu hretu pahnih emaw, pathum emaw kâa tihngheha a awm theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, anni pawh chu a ngaihthlâk duh loh chuan, kohhranho hnênah thlen ang che; tin, kohhranho pawh a ngaihthlâk duh loh chuan, ani chu i tân Jentail leh chhiahkhawntu ang ni rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tihtak meuhvin ka hrilh a che u, lei chungah eng pawh in phuar apiang vânah phuar a ni ang a; lei chungah eng pawh in phelh apiang vânah phelh a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tihtak meuhvin ka hrilh leh a che u, lei chungah hian in zînga mi pahnih, an thil dîl kawnga an thurual chuan, ka Pa vâna mi tihsakin an awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mi pahnih emaw, pathum emaw ka hminga an inkhâwmna apiangah chuan, an zîngah ka awm si ṭhîn a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chumi lai chuan Petera a lo kal a, a hnênah, “Lalpa, ka unauvin ka chungah thil tisual sela, vawi eng zât nge ka ngaihdam ang? Vawi sarih thlengin em ni ang?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Isuan a hnênah, “ ‘Vawi sarih thlengin,’ ka ti lo a che, ‘Vawi sarih hmun sawmsarih thlengin,’ ka ti zâwk che a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chumi avâng chuan, vânram chu, lalber tu emaw a bâwihte hnêna sum chanchin tihfel tum nên chuan tehkhin a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, a han tihfel ṭan chuan mi pakhat talent sîngkhat ba a hnênah an rawn hruai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, pêk tûr a neih loh avângin a pu chuan amah nên, a nupui nên, a fate nên, a neih zawng zawng nên hralha rulh tûr thu a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chutichuan, bâwih chuan, ‘Ka pu, ka chungah zahngai rih la, a zain ka pe vek ang che,’ tiin bawkkhupin chibai a bûk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tichuan, chu bâwiha pu chuan a khawngaih ta êm êm a, a thlah a, a bat chu a ngaidam ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Nimahsela, chu bâwih chu a kal chhuak a, a bâwihpuite zînga pakhat, a duli za ba a va hmu a; tin, a man a, ‘I bat kha mi pe rawh,’ tiin a hrawkah a rêk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Chutichuan, a bâwihpui chu a bawkkhup a, ‘Ka chungah zahngai rih la, ka la pe ang che,’ tiin a ngên chiam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Nimahsela, a duh lo va; a bat chu a tlâk hma loh zawng tân inah a va khung ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chutichuan, a bâwihpuite chuan a thiltih chu an hmuhin an lungngai êm êm a, a thiltih zawng zawng chu an pu an va hrilh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Chu veleh a pu chuan ani chu a ko va, a hnênah, ‘Bâwih sual, mi dîl chiam avâng khân i bat zawng zawng kha ka ngaidam che a ni a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />ka khawngaih che ang khân nang pawhin i bâwihpui chu i khawngaih ve tûr a ni lâwm ni?’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tin, a pu chu a thinur ta a, a bat zawng zawng a tlâk hma loh zawng nghaisatute hnênah a pe ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Mi tinin thinlung taka in unaute in ngaihdam loh chuan, ka Pa vâna mi pawhin chutiang bawkin in chungah a ti ve ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, Isua chu chûng thu a sawi zawh veleh chuan, Galili ram ata a chhuak a, Jordan lui râla Judai ramah chuan a va kal a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />tin, mipui tam takin an zui a; chutah chuan anmahni chu a tidam ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Pharisaite a hnênah an lo kal a, amah fiah nân, “Eng vâng pawhin miin a nupui mâk a thiang em?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “A tîr ata an siamtu khân hmeichhia leh mipaa a siam leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />‘Hemi avâng hian mipain a nu leh a pa a kalsan ang a, a nupui a vuan ang; tichuan, an pahnih chuan tisa pumkhat an lo ni tawh ang,’ a ti tih in chhiar lo vem ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chutichuan, pahnih an ni tawh lo va, tisa pumkhat an ni tawh zâwk a ni. Chuvângin, Pathianin a zawm tawh chu mihringin ṭhen suh se,” a ti a, a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Anni chuan a hnênah, “A nih leh, engati nge Mosian inmâkna lehkha pêka mâk tûr thu a pêk si?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ani chuan an hnênah, “Mosian in thinlung khauh avângin asin in nupuite mâk a phal ni; nimahsela, a tîr ata chutiang a ni si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kei chuan ka ti a che u, ‘Tu pawh tlangvâl ngaih vâng ni lova nupui maa mi dang nei apiang chu a uire a ni; mâk hnu nei apiang pawh a uire a ni,’ ” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Zirtîrte chuan a hnênah, “Nupui kawngah mipa thu chutiang a nih si chuan, inneih hi a ṭha lo ve,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ani erawh chuan an hnênah, “Chu thu chu mi nazawngin an pawm thei lo ve, a pêkate chauh lo chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi tilreh, an nu pum chhûng ata chutianga piang rêngte an awm a; mi tilreh, mihring kuta rehte an awm bawk a; mi tilreh, vânram avânga tilreha insiam chawpte an awm bawk a. Tu pawh a pawm thei apiangin pawm rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chumi lai chuan an chunga a kut a nghaha a ṭawngṭaisak tûrin, a hnênah naupang tête an rawn hruai a; tin, zirtîrte chuan an lo hau va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Isua erawh chuan, “Naupang tête ka hnênah han kaltîr ula, hnar suh u; vânram chu hetiang mite ta a ni si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, an chungah a kut a nghat a, chuta ta chu a kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, mi pakhat a hnênah a lo kal a, “Zirtîrtu, chatuana nunna ka neih theih nân thil ṭha eng nge ka tih ang?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan a hnênah, “Thil ṭha thu engah nge mi zawh? Ṭha chu pakhat chauh a awm; eng pawh ni sela, nunnaa luh i duh chuan thupêkte chu zâwm rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan a hnênah, “A eng ber hi maw?” a ti a. Tin, Isuan, “ ‘Tual i that tûr a ni lo’, ‘I uire tûr a ni lo’, ‘I ru tûr a ni lo’, ‘Dâwtin i hêk tûr a ni lo’,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />‘I nu leh i pa chawimawi rawh,’ tihte leh, ‘Nangmah i inhmangaih angin i vêngte i hmangaih tûr a ni,’ tih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tlangvâl chuan a hnênah, “Chûng thu zawng zawng chu ka zâwm ṭhîn; eng nge ka la bâk?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Isuan a hnênah, “Ṭha famkima awm i duh chuan, kal la, i neih chu hralh la, pachhiate hnênah pe rawh; chutichuan, vânah ro i nei ang; tin, lo kal la, mi zui ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tlangvâl erawh chuan chu thu chu a hriatin, lungngai takin a kal bo ta a; sum tam tak nei mi a nih avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, Isuan a zirtîrte hnênah chuan, “Tihtak meuhvin ka hrilh a che u, mi hausa tân vânrama luh chu harsa tak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, ka hrilh leh a che u, mi hausa Pathian rama luh aiin, hriau benga sanghâwngsei luh tlang a awl zâwk,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, zirtîrten chu chu an hriat chuan mak an ti nasa êm êm a, “Tu nge chhandam ni thei ang le?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, Isuan anni chu a en a, an hnênah, “Chu chu mihring tân tih rual a ni lo va; Pathian nên erawh chuan engkim tih theih a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, Peteran a hnênah, “Ngai teh, keinin engkim kalsanin kan zui ta chia; eng nge kan hmuh ang le?” a ti a, a zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, Isuan a hnênah, “Tihtak meuhvin ka hrilh a che u, Siamtharnaah chuan, Mihring Fapa a ropuina ṭhutphaha a ṭhut hunah, nangni mi zuituteho hi, Israel hnam sâwm leh hnam hnihte chu ngaihtuahin, lalṭhutphah sâwm leh pahnihah in la ṭhu ve ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, mi tin, inte emaw, unaute emaw, farnute emaw, pa emaw, nu emaw, fate emaw, ramte emaw ka hming avânga kalsan apiang chuan a leh za an hmu ang a, chatuana nunna an la chang bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Nimahsela, mi tam tak, hmasa bera awmte chu hnuhnûng berah an la awm ang a; hnuhnûng berte pawh hmasa berah an la awm ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Vânram chu, in neitupa a grêp huana hnathawktute ruai tûra zînga chhuaka ang chu a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan hnathawktute nên chuan ni khata duli hlawha an inrem veleh, a grêp huanah chuan a tîr ta hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, fehrehsân lai vêlin a va chhuak a, mi dang, dâwr hmuna ding mai maite a hmu a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />tin, an hnênah, ‘Nangni pawh grêp huanah va kal ve tawh u, a mawi tâwk apiang ka pe ang che u,’ a ti a. Tichuan, an kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, chawfâk hun lai vêlah leh behliang mun hun lai vêlah chuan a va chhuak leh a, chutiang bawk chuan a ti leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, pahmei zanriah chhum hun lai vêlah chuan a va chhuak a, mi dang dingte a hmu a; tin, an hnênah, ‘Engati nge nilêngin heta in din mai mai ni?’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Anni chuan a hnênah, ‘Tu mân min rawih loh avângin,’ an ti a. Ani chuan an hnênah, ‘Nangni pawh grêp huanah va kal ve tawh u,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, khua a lo tlai lam chuan, grêp huan neitupa chuan a sum enkawltu hnênah, ‘Hnathawktute kha ko la, a hnuhnûng bera ṭanin a hmasa ber thlengin an hlawh pe rawh,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, pahmei zanriah chhum hun lai vêla a rawihte chu an lo kal chuan, duli an hmu ṭheuh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, a hmasa berte chu an lo kal chuan, hmuh tam deuh an inring a; nimahsela, anni pawh chuan duli bawk an hmu ṭheuh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, an han dawn chuan, ‘Hêng hnuhnûng berte hian dârkâr khat chauh an thawk a, keini chhûn hrehawm leh thawsa tuartute tlukin i siam si,’ tiin in neitupa chungah chuan an phunnawi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ani erawh chuan, an zînga mi pakhat hnênah, ‘ṭhiana, i chungah eng mah ka tisual hlei nêm: duli hlawhah kan inrem lo vem ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />I ta kha la la, kal mai rawh; nangmah ka pêk che ang bawk kha he hnuhnûng ber hnênah hian ka pe duh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka ta na na na chu ka duh duha ka tih a thiang lo vem ni? A nih loh leh kei ka ṭhat avângin nangin i îtsîk em ni?’ tiin a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chutiangin, hnuhnûng berte chu a hmasa berte an la ni ang a, hmasa berte pawh chu a hnuhnûng berte an la ni ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, Isua Jerusalem khuaa a han chhoh laiin, zirtîr sâwm leh pahnihte chu a hruai hrang a, kalkawngah chuan an hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Ngai teh u, Jerusalem khuaa kan chhoh dâwn hi; Mihring Fapa hi puithiam lalte leh lehkhaziaktute kutah mantîrin a awm dâwn a ni; tin, anni chuan thi tûrin a chungah thu an titlu ang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />nuihza siam nâna hman tûr leh, vuak tûr leh, kraws-a khenbeh tûrin Jentail-te hnênah an pe ang; tin, ni thum nîah kaihthawhin a awm ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chumi lai chuan Zebedaia fapate nu chu a fapate hruaiin a hnênah a lo kal a, chibai a bûk a, thil eng emaw a dîl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan a hnênah, “Eng nge i duh?” a ti a. Tin, anin a hnênah, “Hêng ka fapate pahnih hi i ramah, i ding lamah pakhat, i vei lamah pakhat an ṭhut theihna tûrin thu pe ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Isua erawh chuan, “In dîl chu in hre lo a ni. Ka no in tûr chu in in thei em ni?” a ti a, a chhâng a. Annin a hnênah, “Thei e,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ani chuan an hnênah, “Ka no chu in in ngei ang; nimahsela, ka ding lam leh vei lama ṭhut tûr thu chu keia pêk tûr a ni lo va, ka Pa buatsaihsakate tân a ni zâwk ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, sâwmte chuan chu chu an lo hriatin unau pahnihte chungah chuan an thinur ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Isua erawh chuan anniho chu a ko va, “Jentail-te chunga rorêltute chu an chungah an lal êm êm ṭhîn a, an mi liante chuan an chungah thu an nei êm êm bawk ṭhîn tih in hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Nimahsela, nangni zîngah zawng chutiang a ni lo vang; tu pawh in zînga mi lian nih duh apiang chu in rawngbâwltuah a awm zâwk tûr a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />tu pawh in zînga hmasa ber nih duh apiang chu in chhiahhlawhah a awm bawk tûr a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Mihring Fapa hi rawngbâwlsaka awm tûrin a lo kal lo va, rawngbâwl tûr leh mi tam tak tlan nâna a nun pe tûr zâwka a lo kal ang khân,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, Jeriko khua ata an chhuah laiin mipui tam takin amah chu an zui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, ngai teh, mitdel pahnih kawng sîra ṭhu chuan Isua a kal tih an hriat veleh, “Lalpa, Davida Fapa, min khawngaih rawh,” tiin an au va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, mipui chuan ngawi tûrin an hau va; nimahsela, anni chuan, “Lalpa, Davida Fapa, min khawngaih rawh,” tiin an au lehzual a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, Isua a ding a, anmahni a ko va, “In chungah engtia ka tih nge in duh?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Anni chuan a hnênah, “Mit vâr kan duh,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tichuan, Isuan a khawngaih êm êm a, an mit a dek a; tichuan, an hmu thei ta nghâl a, amah chu an zui ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Jerusalem khua an thlen dâwnin, Bethphage khua, Olive tlâng chu an thlen chuan, Isuan zirtîrte pahnih a tîr a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />an hnênah, “In hma zâwn khuaah sâwn va kal ta ula, sabengtung thlun, a kianga a no nên, in hmu mai ang; phelh ula, ka hnênah han kai rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, tu pawhin in hnênah eng pawh an sawi chuan, ‘Lalpan a duh a ni,’ in ti ang a; tin, ani chuan a rawn tîr nghâl mai ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“ ‘En teh, i Lal chu, thuhnuairawlh takin, Sabengtung chungah, sabengtungno chung ngeia chuangin i hnênah a lo kal dâwn e,’ tiin Zion fanu chu hrilh rawh,” tia zâwlnei kâa a sawi kha a lo thlen theihna tûrin, chûng chu a lo awm ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tichuan, zirtîrte chu an va kal a, Isuan an hnêna thu a pêk ang ngei chuan an va ti a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />sabengtung leh a no chu an rawn kai a, a chungah chuan an puante an phah a, ani chuan a chuan chhan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, mipui zînga a tam zâwkin kalkawngah chuan an puante an phah a; mi dangin thinga mi chhâwl an sât a, kalkawngah an phah bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, mipui a hma lama kalte leh a zuitute chuan, “Davida fapa hnênah Hosanna! Lalpa hminga lo kal chu fakin awm rawh se, Chungnung berah khian Hosanna!” tiin an au va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Jerusalem khuaa a lo luh chuan, a khuain, “He mi hi tu nge ni?” tiin, an phu ta mur mur a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, mipuiho chuan, “He mi hi zâwlnei Isua, Galili rama Nazareth khuaa mi chu a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Isua chu Pathian biak inah chuan a va lût a, biak ina englo zuartute leh leitute zawng zawng chu a hnawt chhuak a, tangka thlengtuho dawhkânte leh, ṭhuro zuarho ṭhutphahte pawh chu a nam thlûksak a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />an hnênah, “ ‘Ka in chu ṭawngtaina in an ti ang,’ tih ziak a ni; nangni erawh chuan suamhmangte pûkah in siam zâwk ṭhin a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Pathian biak inah chuan mitdelte leh kebaite a hnênah an lo kal a; anmahni chu a tidam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nimahsela, puithiam lalte leh lehkhaziaktuten a thilmak tihte leh biak ina, “Davida fapa Hosanna!” tia naupang aute chu an hmuhin an lungni lo êm êm a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />a hnênah, “Hêngho thusawi hi i hria em?” an ti a. Tin, Isuan an hnênah, “Hria e; ‘Nausênte leh hnute hne laite kâa chhuak chuan fakna i tiṭha famkim ta,’ tih hi in chhiar ngai lo vem ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, anni chu a kalsan a, khawpui ata chu a chhuak a, Bethani-ah a kal a; chutah chuan a riak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, zîngah khawpui lama a kîr leh laiin a ril a lo ṭâm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, kawng sîrah chuan theipui kûng a hmu a, a va pan a, a hnah chauh lo chu eng mah a hmu lo va. Tin, a hnênah, “Kumkhuain lo rah tawh suh ang che,” a ti a. Tin, theipui chu a vuai ta nghâl mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, zirtîrte chuan chu chu an hmuhin, “Engtizia nge theipui hi a vuai tâk nghâl mai?” tiin, mak an ti hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, Isuan an hnênah, “Tihtak meuhin ka hrilh a che u, rinna in neiha, in rinhlelh loh chuan, theipui chunga tih ang chang hi in ti lo vang a, he tlâng hnênah pawh hian, ‘Lo insawn la, tuifinriatah lo inpaih rawh,’ in tih chuan, in tih ang chuan a lo awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, engkim, ring chunga ṭawngṭaia in dîl apiang chu in hmu ang,” a ti a, a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, Pathian biak ina a luh hnua a zirtîr lai chuan, puithiam lalte leh vântlâng upate chu a hnênah an lo kal a, a hnênah, “Tu thuin nge hêng thil hi i tih? Tuin nge thu pe che?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, Isuan an hnênah, “Kei pawhin thu kam khat ka zâwt ve ang che u, chu chu min hrilh chuan, tu thuin nge hêng thil hi ka tih ka hrilh ve ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Johana baptisma kha khawia mi thu nge ni? Vâna mi thu nge mihring thu?” a ti a, a chhâng a. Tin, an inngaihtuah a, “ ‘Vâna mi thu,’ kan tih chuan, ‘Engah nge a thu in âwih loh le?’ min ti si ang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, ‘Mihring thu,’ kan tih chuan, mipui chu kan hlau si; mi zawng zawngin Johana chu zâwlneiah an ruat si a,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tichuan, Isua an chhâng a, “Kan hre lo,” an ti a. Ani pawh chuan an hnênah, “Kei pawhin tu thuin nge hêng thil hi ka tih ka hrilh bîk lo vang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Nimahsela, nangnin engtin nge in ngaih? Mi tu emawin fapa pahnih a nei a. Pakhat hnênah chuan a va kal a, ‘Ka fa, vawiinah grêp huanah va thawk rawh,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ani chuan, ‘Ka duh lo,’ a ti a, a chhâng a; nimahsela, nakinah a rilru chu a lo inlamlêt a, a kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, pakhat hnênah pawh chuan a va kal a, chutiang bawk chuan a va ti a. Tin, ani chuan, ‘Lalpa, ka kal ang e,’ a ti a, a chhâng a; nimahsela, a kal ta si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chu mite pahnihah chuan a tu zâwk chuan nge an pa duh zâwng ti le?” a ti a. Anni chuan, “A hmasa zâwk chuan,” an ti a. Isuan an hnênah, “Tihtak meuhvin ka hrilh a che u, chhiahkhawntute leh nawhchizuarte chuan Pathian ramah an luh khalh dâwn che u a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Johana chu felna kawngah chuan in hnênah a lo kal a, amah chu in ring si lo va; chhiahkhawntute leh nawhchizuarte erawh chuan amah chu an ring a; nangnin chu chu in hmuh hnu pawhin, amah chu in rin theihna tûrin in inlamlêt chuang si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tehkhin thu dang ngaithla rawh u: Mi tu emaw, in neitu a awm a, chu mi chuan grêp huan a siam a, palin a hung vêl a, grêp sâwrna khur a lai a, in sâng a sa a; tin, lo enkawltute hnênah thlawhhlawh tûrin a pe a, ram dangah a kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tin, a rah lawh a hun dâwn chuan, a rah la tûrin lo enkawltute hnênah a bâwihte a tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tin, lo enkawltute chuan a bâwihte chu an lo man a, pakhat an vua a, pakhat an tihlum a, pakhat lungin an dêng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tin, bâwih dang, a hmasa pâwl aia tam zâwk a tîr leh a; anniho chungah pawh an hmaa mite an tih ang bawkin an lo ti leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Chumi hnuah erawh chuan, ‘Ka fapa hi chu an zah ang,’ tiin, a fapa chu an hnênah a tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Nimahsela, lo enkawltute chuan a fapa chu an lo hmuh veleh, ‘He mi hi roluahtu tûr chu a ni; i that ang u khai! A roluah tûr hi i neihsak ang u,’ an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tichuan, ani chu an man a, grêp huan ata chu an theh chhuak a, an tihlum ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Chutichuan, grêp huan neitupa chu a lo kal hunin, chûng lo enkawltute chungah chuan engtin nge a rawn tih ang le?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Anni chuan a hnênah, “Chûng mi sualte chu hrehawm takin a tiboral ang a, grêp huan chu lo enkawltu dang, a lawh hun apianga a rahte chu a hnêna pe zêltu tûrte hnênah, thlawhhlawh tûrin a pe ang,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Isuan an hnênah, “Pathian lehkhaa, ‘In satute lung duh loh kha, Chu ngei chu a kila lung ṭangkai ber a lo ni ta. Chu chu Lalpa tih a ni a, Kan mit hmuhah a mak a ni,’ tih hi in chhiar ngai lo vem ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Chumi avâng chuan, ‘Pathian ram chu in hnên ata lâksak a ni ang a, a rah chhuah tûr hnam hnênah pêk a ni ang,’ tih ka hrilh a che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tin, chumi lung chunga tlu chu a keh sawm ang a; a delh phei chu a râwt dip ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tin, puithiam lalte leh Pharisaite chuan a tehkhin thute chu an hriatin, anmahni chung thu a sawi tih an hre ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tin, amah chu man an tum a; nimahsela, mipuite chu an hlau si a, zâwlneia an ruat avângin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Isuan anmahni a bia a, an hnênah tehkhin thuin a sawi leh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Vânram chu lal tu emaw, a fapa tâna lawi chaw siam nên chuan tehkhin a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, lawi chaw eia a sâwmte chu ko tûrin a bâwihte a tîr a; nimahsela, an lo kal duh lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, ‘Ka sâwmte hnênah, ngai teh u, ka ruai chu ka peih ta; ka sebâwngpate leh ka ran châwm thaute ka talh a, engkim peih a ni ta e; lawi chaw ei tûrin lo kal tawh rawh u, ti rawh u,’ tiin bâwih dangte a tîr leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nimahsela, an lo ngaihsak lo va, an kal ta mai a, pakhat chu a lovah a kal a, pakhat chu a sumdâwnnaah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />mi dangte chuan a bâwihte chu an man a, zahthlâk takin an siam a, an tihlum ta mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chutichuan, lal chu a thinur ta a; a sipaihote a tîr a, chûng tualthattute chu a tiboral a, an khua pawh a hâlsak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, a bâwihte hnênah chuan, ‘Lawi chaw peih a ni ta, ka sâwmte erawh kha chu ei tlâk an ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chutichuan, kawng pêng ṭhuamahte kal ula, mi in hmuh apiang lawi chaw ei tûrin sâwm rawh u,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tichuan, chûng bâwihte chu an chhuak a, kawngahte chuan an va kal a, an hmuh apiang, mi sual leh mi ṭhate pawh an hruai khâwm ta vek a; tichuan, lawi chaw pindan chu mi sâwmtein an lo khat ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nimahsela, lal chu mi sâwmte en tûra a lo luh chuan, inneihna puan sin lo mi pakhat chutah chuan a hmu a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />tichuan, a hnênah, ‘ṭhiana, eng tizia nge ni inneihna puan sin lovin hetah i lo luh le?’ a ti a. Tin, ani chu a ngawi reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, lal chuan a bâwihte hnênah, ‘A kut leh a ke phuar ula, pâwn lam thimah paih chhuak rawh u; chutah chuan ṭah leh ha ṭhial a awm ang,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sâwmte chu tam tak an ni a, thlante erawh chu tlêm tê an ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chumi lai chuan Pharisaite chuan a thusawia an man theihna zia tûr an va inrâwn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, an zirtîrte, Heroda pâwla mite nên, a hnênah an tîr a, chu mite chuan, “Zirtîrtu, mi dik tak i ni a, tihtak zetin Pathian kawng thu i zirtîr ṭhîn a, pawisak chuan tu mah i nei lo tih kan hria e; tu mah thlei bîk i nei si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chutichuan, engtin nge i ngaih min hrilh teh khai? Kaisara hnêna chhiah chawi hi a thiang nge thiang lo?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nimahsela, Isuan an sualzia chu a lo hria a, “Vervêkte u, engah nge min fiah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chhiah tangka chu min entîr rawh u,” a ti a. Tin, a hnênah duli an rawn la a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan an hnênah, “Hei hi tu lem leh tu hming nge ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Anni chuan a hnênah, “Kaisara,” an ti a. Tin, ani chuan an hnênah, “A nih ahnu, Kaisara thilte chu Kaisara hnênah pe ula, Pathian thilte chu Pathian hnênah pe ta che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chûng thu chu an hriatin mak an ti hle a, amah chu an kalsan a, an kal ta daih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chumi ni vêk chuan Saddukaiho, thawhlehna a awm lo tite chu a hnênah an lo kal a; a hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Zirtîrtu, Mosian, ‘Mi, fa nei lovin thi sela, a unaupain a nupui chu neiin a unaupa tân chi a thlahsak tûr a ni,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Aw le, kan zîngah sal sarih an awm a; a upa berin nupui a nei a, a thi a; tin, chi a thlah loh avângin a nupui chu a unaupa rochun tûrin a hnutchhiah a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />chutiang bawkin a pahnihna chuan a ti a, a pathumna chuan a ti bawk a, a pasarihna thlengin an ti ṭheuh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, an zaa an thih hnuah chuan hmeichhia pawh chu a thi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chutichuan, thawhleh hunah chuan an pasarih zîngah chuan tu nupui ber nge ni ang? An zain an nei ṭheuh si a?” tiin an zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Isuan an hnênah, “Pathian Lehkha Thu leh Pathian thiltihtheihna in hriat loh avângin in ngai sual ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Thawhlehnaah chuan nupui pasal an innei dâwn tawh lo va, vâna vântirhkohte ang an ni dâwn zâwk asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, mitthi thawhlehna thu chu, Pathianin, ‘Kei Abrahama Pathian, Isaaka Pathian, Jakoba Pathian ka ni,’ tia in hnêna a sawi kha in chhiar lo vem ni? Pathian chu mitthi Pathian a ni lo va, mi nung Pathian a ni zâwk,” a ti a, a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tin, mipuite chuan chu chu an hriatin a thu zirtîr chu mak an ti hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Pharisaite erawh chu, Isuan Saddukaite a hnial dang tih an hriatin an inkhâwm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tin, an zînga mi pakhat, dân hretuin, “Zirtîrtu, dân thûah eng thupêk hi nge ropui ber?” tiin amah fiah nân thu a zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan a hnênah, “ ‘Lalpa i Pathian chu i thinlung zawng zawngin, i thlarau zawng zawngin, i rilru zawng zawngin i hmangaih tûr a ni,’ tih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Chu chu thupêk ropui leh pawimawh ber a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tin, a dawttu, a anpui chu hei hi a ni, ‘Nangmah i inhmangaih angin i vêngte pawh i hmangaih tûr a ni,’ tih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Chûng thupêk pahnihah chuan dân thu leh zâwlneite thu zawng zawng a inkhai khâwm vek a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tin, Pharisaite chu an inkhâwm lai chuan, Isuan anmahni chu thu a zâwt a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />“Krista chu engtin nge in ngaih? Tu fapa nge ni?” a ti a. Anni chuan a hnênah, “Davida fapa,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Ani chuan an hnênah, “Davidan, ‘Lalpa chuan, ka Lalpa hnênah, I hmêlmate i kephah hnuaia ka dah hma loh zawng, Ka ding lamah ṭhu rawh, a ti,’ tiin, engtiziain nge Thlarauvin ani chu ‘Lalpa’ a tih le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Davidan ani chu ‘Lalpa’ a tih si chuan, engtin nge a fapa a nih theih?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tin, tu mân kam khat mahin an chhâng thei lo va, chumi ni achin chu tu mân thu dang rêng rêng an zâwt ngam tawh hek lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Isuan mipuite leh a zirtîrte hnênah thu a sawi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Lehkhaziaktute leh Pharisaite chu Mosia ṭhutphahah chuan an ṭhu ṭhîn a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />chuvângin, an hrilh apiang che u chu ti ula, zâwm zêl ang che u; an thiltih ang erawh chu ti ve suh ang che u, sawi zawng an sawi ṭhîn a, an ti si ṭhîn lo a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Phur rit hrehawm takte an siam a, mite an bel ṭhîn a, anmahni erawh chuan an kut zungṭang pawhin an tisawn duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />An thiltih zawng zawng chu mihring hmuh atân a ni an tih zâwk ṭhin ni, an thil bun leh khimte chu an tihlai a, an puan hmâwrfêm an tibuk ṭhîn a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />ruaiṭhehnaah hmun ṭha ber te, inkhâwmna inah ṭhutphah ṭha ber te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />dâwr hmuna chibai bûk te, miten ‘Rabbi’ an tih te an ngaina si ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nangni erawh chu ‘Rabbi’ tihin awm suh u; in zirtîrtu chu pakhat chauh a ni a, nangni zawng zawng chu unau in ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, lei chungah hian tu mah ‘Ka pa’ ti suh u; in Pa chu pakhat chauh a ni, vâna mi khi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />‘Hruaitute’ tihin awm hek suh u, in hruaitu chu pakhat chauh a ni, Krista chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />In zînga ropui ber chu in rawngbâwltuah a awm zâwk tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tu pawh inngaihlu apiang an tlâwm ang a, tu pawh inngaitlâwm apiang chawimawiin an awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nimahsela, nangni lehkhaziaktu leh Pharisai vervêkte u, in chung a pik e! Vânram kawng chu mite in khârsak si ṭhîn; nangni lah in lût si lo va, mi lût tûrte pawh luh in phal ṭhîn hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nangni lehkhaziaktu leh Pharisai vervêkte u, in chung a pik e! Saphun pakhat pawh siam tûrin tuifinriat leh khawmual in kal hual si a; tin, chutianga a lo awm veleh ani chu nangmahni leh hnihin Gehenna fapaah in siam ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nangni, hruaitu mitdel, ‘Tu pawh Pathian biak in chhâla chhechham apiang, chu chu eng mah a ni lo; tu pawh Pathian biak ina rangkachak chhâla chhechham apiang erawh chuan hlen tûr a ni,’ tite u, in chung a pik e!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nangni mi â, mitdelte u! A eng nge ropui zâwk, rangkachak nge Pathian biak in, rangkachak tithianghlimtu chu?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, ‘Tu pawh maichâm chhâla chhechham apiang, eng mah a ni lo; a chunga thilpêk awm chhâla chhechham apiang erawh chuan hlen tûr a ni,’ in ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nangni mitdelte u! A eng nge ropui zâwk, thilpêk nge maichâm, thilpêk tithianghlimtu chu?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chutichuan, tu pawh maichâm chhâla chhechham apiang chuan, maichâm leh a chunga awm zawng zawng chhâlin chhia a chham ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tu pawh Pathian biak in chhâla chhechham apiang chuan, Pathian biak in leh a chhûnga awm chu chhâlin chhia a chham ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tu pawh vân chhâla chhechham apiang chuan, Pathian ṭhutphah leh a chunga ṭhu chhâlin chhia a chham ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nangni lehkhaziaktu leh Pharisai vervêkte u, in chung a pik e! Pudina te, mohuri te, zira te chu sâwmah pakhat in pe ṭhîn a, dân thu pawimawh zâwk - felna te, khawngaihna te, rinawmna te chu - in ngaihthah si ṭhîn; nimahsela, chûng chu asin in tih tûr ni, a dangte chu tih ṭhulh chuang lovin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nangni hruaitu mitdel, thosi thli faia sanghâwngsei lem si ṭhînte u!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Lehkhaziaktu leh Pharisai vervêkte u, in chung a pik e! No leh thlêng pâwn lam in sil fai a, a chhûng erawh chu hlêprûkna leh insûm lohnain a khat si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Nang Pharisai mitdel, no leh thlêng chhûng lam chu sil fai hmasa rawh, a pâwn lam pawh a lo fai theihna tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Lehkhaziaktu leh Pharisai vervêkte u, in chung a pik e! Thlân hnawih vâr, pâwn lam mawi taka lang, a chhûng lam erawh chu mitthi ruhte leh bawlhhlawh tinrênga khat angte chu in ni asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Nangni pawh chutiang takin, pâwn lamah chuan mihring mit hmuhin fel takin in lang ṭhîn a, in chhûng lamah erawh chuan vervêkna leh sualnain in khat si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Nangni lehkhaziaktu leh Pharisai vervêkte u, in chung a pik e! Zâwlneiho thlân inte in sa a, mi fel thlânte pawh in chei mawi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />‘Kan pute dam lai khân lo awm ve mah ila, zâwlneite thisen an chhuahnaah chuan kan tel ve lo vang,’ in ti ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chutichuan, zâwlneiho thattute fa in ni tih in inhriattîr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />In pute tehkhâwng chu tikhat nghâl mai rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Rûlte u, rûl thlahte u, Gehenna rorêlna chu engtin nge in pumpelh theih ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ngai teh u, chumi avâng chuan in hnênah zâwlneite, mi fingte, lehkhaziaktute ka rawn tîr dâwn; ṭhenkhat in tihlum ang a, kraws-ah in khêngbet ang, ṭhenkhat in inkhâwmna inahte savun hruiin in vua ang a, khaw tinah in tiduhdah zui zêl ang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />chutichuan, Abela, mi fel tak thisen aṭangin, Pathian biak in leh maichâm inkâra, Berekia fapa Zekaria in thaha thisen thleng khân, lei chunga mi fel thisen an chhuah zawng zawng chu nangmahni chungah a lo la thleng thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tihtak meuhvin ka hrilh a che u, chûng zawng zawng chu tûnlai chhuante chungah hian a lo la thleng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Aw Jerusalem, Jerusalem, zâwlneiho thattu! I hnêna an rawn tirhte lunga lo dêng hlumtu, arpuiin a notê a thla hnuaia a awp khâwm angin i fate vawi eng zât nge awp khâwm ka tum kha! Nimahsela, in duh si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />En teh u, in in chu a ruaka hnutchhiah che uin a awm ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Ka hrilh a che u, ‘Lalpa hminga lo kal chu fakin awm rawh se,’ in tih hma loh chuan, tûn achinah mi hmu leh dâwn tawh lo a nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Isua chu Pathian biak in ata a chhuak a, a kal dâwn a. Tin, a zirtîrte chu Pathian biak inte entîr tûrin a hnênah an lo kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ani erawh chuan an hnênah, “Hêng zawng zawng hi in hmu maw? Tihtak meuhvin ka hrilh a che u, tihchim loh va lung intiang rêng rêng hetah a awm lo vang,” a ti a, a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Olive tlângah chuan a ṭhut laiin zirtîrte chu anmahni chauhvin a hnênah an kal a, “Chûng chu eng tikah nge a lo awm ang? I lo kal lehna leh khawvêl tâwpna chhinchhiahna chu eng nge ni ang, min hrilh rawh,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Isuan a chhâng a, an hnênah, “Tu mân an tihder loh nân che u fîmkhur rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi tam tak, ‘Krista chu ka ni,’ tiin keima hming chhâlin an lo kal ang a, mi tam tak an tihder dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, indo thu leh indo thuthang in la hria ang; in mangan loh nân fîmkhur rawh u; chûng chu a lo thleng tûr rêng a ni; nimahsela, tâwpna chu a la ni rih lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hnam hrang leh hnam hrang an indo vang a, ram hrang leh ram hrang an indo vang a; hmun hrang hrangah ṭâmte a tla ang a, lîrte a nghîng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chûng zawng zawng chu nau vei ṭan tirhna a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chumi hunah chuan hrehawm tuar tûrin an mantîr ang che u a, an tihlum ang che u; ka hming avângin hnam zawng zawng huat in ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chumi hunah chuan mi tam tak an tlu ang a, an inmantîr tawn ang a, an inhaw tawn ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Zâwlnei der tam tak pawh an lo chhuak ang a, mi tam tak an tihder ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, sual a la pun dâwn avângin mi tam zâwk hmangaihna chu a la dai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nimahsela, a tâwp thlenga tuar peih apiang, chu mi ngei chu chhandamin a awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, he Ram Chanchin Ṭha hi hnam zawng zawng hriattîrna tûrin khawvêl zawng zawngah hrilin a awm ang a; chumi zawhah chuan tâwpna chu a lo thleng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chutichuan, tiṭiautu tenawm, zâwlnei Daniela sawia kha, hmun thianghlima dinga in hmuh hunah chuan (a chhiar apiangin a awmzia hre rawh se)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Judai rama awmte chu tlângahte tlân bo rawh se;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />in chunga awm chu a ina englo chuh tûrin chhuk suh se;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />tin, lova awm chu a puan chuh tûrin kîr leh suh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chûng nîah chuan raite leh nau no pawmte chung chu a pik ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, in tlân bo hun tûr chu thlasikah emaw, Chawlhniah emaw a lo thlen loh nân ṭawngṭai rawh u;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />chumi hunah chuan hrehawm nasa tak a awm dâwn si a; chutianga nasa rêng rêng chu leilung pian tirh ata tûn thlengin a la awm ngai lo va, awm pawh eng tikah mah a lo awm leh tawh hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, chûng nite chu tihtawi ni suh sela, mihring rêng rêng damin an chhuak lo vang; nimahsela, thlante avâng chuan chûng nite chu tihtawi a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chutih hunah chuan tu pawhin in hnênah, ‘En teh, Krista chu heta hi a awm,’ emaw, ‘Heta hi’ emaw, an tih chuan âwih suh ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Krista derte leh zâwlnei derte an lo chhuak dâwn si a, chûng chuan thei ang sela, thlante meuh pawh an tihder theih nân chhinchhiahna leh thilmak ropui takte an ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ngai teh u, ka hrilh lâwk tawh che u hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chutichuan, in hnênah, ‘Ngai teh u, thlalêrah a awm,’ an tih che u chuan, kal chhuak suh u; ‘Pindan chhûngrilahte a awm,’ an tih che u chuan, âwih duh suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Kâwl, chhak lamah a lo phe chhuak a, thlang lam thleng pawhin a lang ṭhîn a, Mihring Fapa lo kal lehna chu chutiang chu a ni dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Khawiah pawh sa ruang awmna apiangah mulukawlhte pawh an awm khâwm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Nimahsela, chûng ni hrehawm hnu lawkah chuan nî tih thimin a awm ang a, thla a êng tawh lo vang a, vân aṭangin arsite a lo tla ang a, vân thiltihtheihnate chu tihnghîn a ni ang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />chutih hunah chuan Mihring Fapa chhinchhiahna chu vânah a lang ang. Chumi hunah chuan leia chi tinin an âwmte an inchûm ang a, Mihring Fapa hi thiltihtheihna leh ropuina nasa tak nên, vân chhûm chunga lo kal an hmu ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, a vântirhkohte chu, tawtawrâwt ri nasa tak nên a tîr chhuak ang. Anni chuan a thlante chu kâwl kil li ata - vân tâwp aṭanga a tâwp lehlam thlengin - an lâwr khâwm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tichuan, theipui kûngah hian a tehkhin thu zîr rawh u: a ṭang a lo nova, a hnah a lo chawr chuan nipui a thaw dâwn tih in hre ṭhin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />chutiang bawkin, nangni pawhin chûng zawng zawng chu in hmuh hun chuan, amah chu a lo hnai tawh a, kawngka bul ngeiah a awm tih hria ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tihtak meuhvin ka hrilh a che u, chûng zawng zawng chu a thlen kim hma loh zawng tûnlai chhuante hi an ral lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Lei leh vân a ral ang a, ka thu erawh chu a ral lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Nimahsela, chumi ni leh a hun thu chu Pa chauh lo chuan tu mân, vâna vântirhkohte pawhin, Fapa pawhin an hre lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tin, Nova dam lai ang bawk kha, Mihring Fapa lo kal lehna chu a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Chûng ni, tuilêt hmate chuan, Nova lawnga a luh ni thlengin an eiin an bâr a, nupui pasal an innei ṭhîn;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />tui a lo lêta, an zaa a lâk bo vek hma loh chuan eng mah an hre lo va; Mihring Fapa lo kal lehna chu chutiang bawk chu a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Chumi hunah chuan lovah mi pahnih an awm ang a; pakhat chu kal bopuiin a awm ang a, pakhat chu hnutchhiahin a awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Hmeichhe pahnih buh râwt sawmnaah buh râwt sawmin an awm ang a; pakhat chu kal bopuiin a awm ang a, pakhat chu hnutchhiahin a awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Chutichuan, ngaihven rawh u, eng nîah nge in Lalpa a lo kal dâwn in hre si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Nimahsela, hei hi hre rawh u, rûkru a lo kal hun tûr in neituin hria sela, a vêng ang a, a in a reh pawhtîr lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Chuvângin, nangni pawh inring rengin awm rawh u, in rin loh hunah Mihring Fapa a lo kal dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Bâwih rinawm, fing tak, a puin a hun apianga an chaw chan tûr semsak tûra a chhûngte chunga hotua a siama chu tu ber nge ni ang le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />A pu a lo kal huna bâwih chutiang tia a rawn hmuha chu a eng a thâwl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Tihtak meuhvin ka hrilh a che u, a neih zawng zawng chungah hotuah a siam ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, bâwih sual chuan a rilruin, ‘Ka pu a lo kal lawk dâwn lo ve,’ tiin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />a bâwihpuite lo vêl ta sela, mi ruite hnênah eiin bâr sela,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />chu bâwiha pu chu a rin loh nîah, a hriat loh laiin a lo kal ang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />bung hnihah a rawn chhuah ang a, mi vervêkte chan ang a chantîr ang; chutah chuan ṭah leh ha ṭhial chu a awm ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chumi hunah chuan, vânram chu nula thianghlim sâwm, an khâwnvâr kenga mo neitu hmuak tûra chhuakte nên chuan tehkhin a ni tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />An zînga mi panga an â a, panga an fing.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A âte chuan an khâwnvârte an kenin, a tui an keng tel si lo va;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />a fingte erawh chuan an khâwnvârte an keng a, an ûmte chuan a tui an keng tel bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, mo neitu chu a lo kal har avângin an zain an muthlu a, an lo muhîl ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, zanlai takah chuan, ‘Ngai teh u, mo neitu chu a lo kal e! A hmuak tûrin lo chhuak r’u khai!’ tiin au thâwm a lo awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chu veleh chuan nula thianghlimho chu an tho vek a, an khâwnvârte chu an buatsaih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, a âte chuan a fingte hnênah, ‘In khâwnvâr tui kha min pe ve rawh u; kan khâwnvârte a thi dâwn e,’ an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nimahsela, a fingte chuan, ‘Keini leh nangni tân a daih lo vang e; a zuartute hnênah kal ula, lei ve zâwk rawh u,’ tiin an chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, lei tûra an kal bo hlân chuan mo neitu chu a lo thleng ta a; tichuan, a peihte chu amah nên lawi chaw eiin an lût a; tin, kawng chu an khâr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chumi hnuah chuan nula thianghlim dangte pawh chu an lo thleng a, ‘Ka pu, ka pu, min hawnsak rawh!’ an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ani erawh chuan, ‘Tihtak meuhvin ka hrilh a che u, ka hre lo che u a ni,’ a ti a, a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chutichuan, ngaihven rawh u, a ni leh a hun chu in hre si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mi, ram danga kal dâwna, ama bâwihte kova, a sumte an hnêna kawltîr ang chu a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bâwih pakhat hnênah talent nga a pe a, bâwih dang hnênah talent hnih a pe a, bâwih dang hnênah talent khat a pe a; an tih theih tâwk tûr ang zêl ṭheuhvin a pe a; tichuan, a kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, talent nga dawngtu chu chûng chuan a va sumdâwng ta nghâl a, talent nga dang a dek chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chutiang bawkin talent hnih dawngtua pawh chuan talent hnih dang a dek chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Talent khat dawngtu erawh chu a va kal a, lei a lai a, a pu tangka chu a thukru ta zâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, rei tak hnuah chûng bâwihho pu chu a lo haw a, an hnênah a sum chanchin a tifel a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tichuan, talent nga dawngtu chu a lo kal a, talent nga dang a rawn keng a, ‘Ka pu, nangin talent nga mi kawltîr kha; en teh, talent nga dang ka dek chhuak e,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A pu chuan a hnênah, ‘Bâwih ṭha leh rinawm, i tiṭha e; tlêm te chungah i rinawm a, tam tak chungah ka awmtîr ang che; i pu lâwmnaah lût rawh,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, talent hnih dawngtu pawh chu a lo kal a, ‘Ka pu, nangin talent hnih mi kawltîr kha; en teh, talent hnih dang ka dek chhuak e,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A pu chuan a hnênah, ‘Bâwih ṭha leh rinawm, i ti ṭha e; tlêm te chungah i rinawm a, tam tak chungah ka awmtîr ang che; i pu lâwmnaah lût rawh,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, talent khat dawngtu pawh chu a lo kal a, ‘Ka pu, mi ti kher kher i ni tih ka hria a che; i tuh lohnaah pawh i ât ṭhîn a, i tihdarh lohnaah pawh i seng ṭhîn a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />tichuan, ka hlau va, ka va kal a, i talent kha leiah ka thukru a; en teh, i ta ngai kha i hmuh leh hi,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A pu chuan a hnênah, ‘Bâwih sual leh zawmthawpa, ka tuh lohnaah pawh ka âta, ka tihdarh lohnaah pawh ka seng ṭhîn tih i hria maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Chuti a nih ahnu, ka tangka chu sumdâwngtute hnênah lo dah tawh tûr i ni; chutichuan, ka lo haw hian ka ta hi a pung nên ka hmu leh tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tichuan, a talent khat kha lâksak ula, talent sâwm neitu hnênah pe rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tu pawh a nei apiang an pêk belhchhah ang a, a lo ngah ang; tu pawh a nei lo apiang erawh chu a neih chhun pawh an lâksak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, bâwih ṭhahnem lo kha pâwn lam thimah chuan paih chhuak rawh u; chutah chuan ṭah leh ha ṭhial chu a awm ang,’ a ti a, a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, Mihring Fapa hi chu, a vântirhkohte zawng zawng nên, a ropuinaa inthuama a lo kal hunah chuan, a ropuina ṭhutphahah a ṭhu ang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />a hmaah chuan hnam tin an inkhâwm ang a; berâm vêngtuin kêl zîng ata a berâmte a hlîr angin anniho chu a hlîr ang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />berâmte chu a ding lamah a dah ang a, kêlte erawh chu a vei lamah a dah ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Chumi hunah chuan Lalber chuan a ding lama mite hnênah chuan, ‘Ka Pa voh bîkte u, lo kal ula, khawvêl siam ṭan tirh ata in tâna ram buatsaih chu chang rawh u;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />ka ril a ṭâmin nangnin ei tûr mi pe a; ka tui a hâlin in tûr mi pe a; mikhual ka nihin mi thleng a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />saruak ka nihin puan mi sintîr a; ka damlohvin mi kan a; tân ina ka awmin ka hnênah in lo kal si a,’ a la ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Chumi hunah chuan mi felte chuan, ‘Lalpa, eng tikah nge riltâmin kan hmuh chia, ei tûr kan pêk che? Tuihâlin kan hmuh chia, in tûr kan pêk che?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Eng tikah nge mikhuala kan hmuh chia, kan thlen che? Saruaka kan hmuh chia, puan kan sintîr che?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Eng tikah nge damlovin emaw, tân inah emaw kan hmuh chia, i hnêna kan lo kal?’ tiin an la chhâng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tin, Lalber chuan an hnênah, ‘Tihtak meuhin ka hrilh a che u, hêng ka unau tê berte zînga mi pakhat chunga in tih chu ka chunga ti in ni,’ tiin a la chhâng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Chumi zawhah chuan, a vei lama mite hnênah pawh chuan, ‘Ânchhe dawngte u, kumkhaw mei, Diabola leh a tirhkohte tân an buatsaihah chuan mi kal bosan rawh u;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />ka ril a ṭâmin nangnin ei tûr mi pe lo va; ka tui a hâlin in tûr mi pe lo va;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />mikhual ka nihin mi thleng lo va; saruak ka nihin puan mi sintîr lo va; damlo leh tân ina ka awmin mi kan si lo,’ a la ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Chumi hunah chuan anni pawhin, ‘Lalpa, eng tikah nge rilṭâmin emaw, tuihâlin emaw, mikhualin emaw, saruakin emaw, damlovin emaw, tân inah emaw kan hmuh chia, rawng kan bâwlsak loh che?’ tiin an la chhâng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan an hnênah, ‘Tihtak meuhin ka hrilh a che u, hêng mi tê berte zînga mi pakhat chunga in tih loh chu ka chunga ti lo in ni,’ tiin a la chhâng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tin, chûng chu kumkhaw hremnaah an kal ang a; mi felte erawh chu kumkhaw nunnaah an kal ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, Isuan chûng thu zawng zawng chu a sawi zawh chuan a zirtîrte hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Ni hnih achinah Kalhlên Kût a lo awm dâwn tih in hria a, Mihring Fapa hi khenbeh tûrin an mantîr dâwn a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chumi lai chuan, puithiam lalber Kaiapha an tiha in hual chhûng kawtlaiah chuan puithiam lalte leh vântlâng upate chu an inkhâwm a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Isua chu ngamthlêma mana, an tihhlum theihna tûrin an inrâwn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nimahsela, “Kût chhûng chuan ni suh se; chuti lo chuan, vântlâng zîngah buaina a lo awm dah ang e,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Isua chu Bethani khuaah, phâr Simona ina a awm laiin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />hmeichhe pakhat alabasta bâwma hriak rimtui to tak kengin a hnênah a lo kal a, a chaw kîl laiin a lûah a leih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nimahsela, zirtîrte chuan chu chu an hmuhin an thinur a, “Eng atân nge hetia a tihboral mai mai ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />He hriak hi man tam taka hralha, mi retheite hnênah pêk theih a ni si a,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Isua erawh chuan chu chu a hriatin an hnênah, “Hmeichhia hi engah nge in tihbuai ni? Ka chungah hian thil ṭha tak a ti a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mi retheite chu kumkhuaa in hnêna awm an ni alâwm, kei erawh chu kumkhuaa in hnêna awm tûr ka ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />He hriak rimtui ka taksaa a leih hi, phûm tûra mi buatsaih tûrin a ti a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tihtak meuhvin ka hrilh a che u, khawvêl zawng zawngah, khawiah pawh he Chanchin Ṭha hi an hrilna apiangah, he hmeichhe thiltih pawh hi amah hriat rengna tûrin an sawi ve zêl ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chumi hnuah chuan sâwm leh pahnihte zînga mi pakhat, Juda Iskariota an tiha chu puithiam lalte hnênah a kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Amah chu ka mantîr ang che u a, eng nge mi pêk ang?” a ti a. Tin, tangka sawmthum an bûksak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chumi chinah chuan mantîrna remchâng a zawng ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, chhang dawidim telh loh ni, ni hmasa berah chuan zirtîrte chu Isua hnênah an lo kal a, “Kalhlên Kût chaw eina tûrin khawiah nge buatsaihsak che ila i duh?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “Khawpuiah tu emaw hnênah kal ula, a hnênah, ‘Zirtîrtu chuan, “Ka hun a hnai ta a; ka zirtîrte nên Kalhlên Kût i inah kan kût ang e,” a ti e,’ va ti ang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, Isuan an hnêna a tih angin zirtîrte chuan an ti a; Kalhlên Kût chaw chu an buatsaih ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, khua a lo tlai lam chuan zirtîr sâwm leh pahnihte nên chaw an kîl a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />tin, an ei laiin ani chuan, “Tihtak meuhvin ka hrilh a che u, in zînga mi pakhat hian mi mantîr ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, an lungngai ta êm êm a, a hnênah, “Lalpa, keimah em ni?” an ti ta ṭheuh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “Thlêng mi zenpuitu ngei chuan mi mantîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mihring Fapa hi a chanchin an ziak ang tak khân a kal dâwn a ni; nimahsela, Mihring Fapa mantîrtu tûr mihring chung chu a pik e! Chu mihring chu piang suh sela a tân a ṭha zâwk ang,” tiin a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, a mantîrtu tûr Juda chuan a chhâng a, “Rabbi, keimah em ni?” a ti a. Ani chuan a hnênah, “Ni e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, an ei laiin Isuan chhang a la a, mal a sâwmsak a, a phel a; tin, zirtîrte hnênah chuan a pe a, “La ula, ei rawh u; hei hi ka taksa a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, no a la a, lâwmthu a sawi a, an hnênah a pe a, “In zain in rawh u;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />hei hi ka thisen, sualte ngaihdam nâna mi tam tak tâna chhuak tûr, thuthlunna chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Nimahsela, ka hrilh a che u, ka Pa ramah nangmahni nêna a thar ka in ni a thlen hma loh zawng, tûn achinah grêp hrui raha mi hi ka in leh tawh lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, hla an sak zawhin an chhuak a, Olive tlângah chuan an kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, Isuan an hnênah, “Zâninah hian in zain ka chung thûah lungni lovin in awm vek ang; ‘Berâm vêngtu chu ka vua ang a, berâm rual chu an darh ang,’ tih ziak a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Nimahsela, ka thawhleh hnuin Galili ramah in hmaah ka kal ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Petera erawh chuan a hnênah, “An zain i chung thûah lungni lovin awm mah sela, kei zawng lungni lovin ka awm tawp lo vang,” tiin a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Isuan a hnênah, “Tihtak meuhvin ka hrilh a che, zâninah hian âr a khuan hmain nangin vawi thum mi phat ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Peteran a hnênah, “I thihnaah chuan thi ve dâwn mah ila, ka phat tawp lo vang che,” a ti a. Chutiang bawk chuan zirtîrte zawng zawng chuan an ti ta ṭheuh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Chumi zawhah chuan, Isua chu anniho nên hmun pakhat Gethsemane an tih chu an thleng a; tin, ani chuan a zirtîrte hnênah, “Sawta ka va ṭawngṭai chhûng zawng hetah hian lo ṭhu rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tin, Petera leh Zebedaia fapate pahnih chu a hruai a, a lungngaiin a lo mangang ta êm êm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tin, an hnênah, “Ka rilru a lungngai êm êm a, thihna khawp hial a ni; hetah hian awm ula, mi vênpui rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tin, tlêmin hma lamah a va kal hlek a, a bawkkhup a, “Aw ka Pa, a theih chuan he no hian mi pêl lul rawh se; nimahsela, keima thu ni lovin, nangma thû thû ni zâwk rawh se,” tiin a ṭawngṭai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tin, zirtîrte hnênah chuan a lo kal a, anni chu muhîlin a rawn hmu a; tichuan Petera hnênah, “E khai! Nangin dârkâr khat pawh mi vênpui thei lo a ni maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Thlêmnaa in luh loh nân inring rengin ṭawngṭai rawh u; thlarau zawngin a peih a, tisa erawh chu a chak lo a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tin, vawi hnihnaah a va kal a, a ṭawngṭai leh a, “Aw ka Pa, ka in loh va hei hian mi pelh theih lul loh chuan, nangma thû thû ni rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tin, a lo kal leh a, anniho chu muhîlin a rawn hmu leh a, an mut a chhuak hle si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tin, a kalsan leh a, a vawi thumnaah a thusawi ngai sawiin a ṭawngṭai leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Chumi zawhah chuan zirtîrte hnênah a lo kal leh a, an hnênah, “Tûnah zawng muhîl ula, châwl tawh rawh u! Ngai teh u, a hun chu a lo thleng ta a, Mihring Fapa hi mi sualte kutah an mantîr dâwn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tho ula, i kal ang u; en teh u, mi mantîrtu tûr chu a lo hnaih tâk hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Tin, a la sawi lai mêkin Juda, sâwm leh pahnihte zînga mi pakhat chu a lo thleng ta a, ama rual chuan puithiam lalte leh lehkhaziaktute leh upate hnên ata mipui tam tak, khandaih leh talhtum kengin an lo thleng bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tin, a mantîrtu tûr chuan chhinchhiahna tûr a lo hrilh lâwk diam a, “Ka fawh apiang chu amah a ni ang, man ang che u,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Tichuan, Isua chu a va pan ta nghâl a, “Chibai, Rabbi!” tiin a fâwp ta ngawih ngawih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Tin, Isuan a hnênah, “Ṭhiana, i rawn kal chhan chu ti rawh,” a ti a. Chu veleh Isua chu an chelh a, an man ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Tin, ngai teh, Isua hote zînga pakhat chuan a kutin a ban a, a khandaih a phawi a, puithiam lalber bâwih chu a sât a, a beng a sah thlâksak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Tin, Isuan a hnênah, “I khandaih kha a dahnaah dah leh rawh, khandaih ruaitu zawng zawng chu khandaih vêkah an thi dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Tûnah pawh vântirhkoh sângruk hmun sâwm leh hmun hnih aia tam zâwk mi rawn tirhsak tûrin ka Pa hnênah ngên thei lovin mi ring em ni le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Nimahsela, ngên ang ila, engtin nge Pathian Lehkha Thu, hetianga a lo awm tûr thu hi, a thlen theih ang le?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Chumi lai tak chuan Isuan mipuite hnênah chuan, “Khandaihte, talhtumte kengin, suamhmang man tûr ang maiin min man tûrin in lo chhuak a ni maw? Pathian biak inah ni tin zirtîrin ka ṭhu ṭhîn a, min man si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Nimahsela, zâwlnei lehkha thute chu a lo thlen theihna tûrin hêng zawng zawng hi a lo awm ta a nih hi,” a ti a. Chumi lai chuan zirtîrte zawng zawng chuan amah chu an thlahthlam a, an tlân bo ta vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Tin, Isua mantute chuan puithiam lalber Kaiapha ina lehkhaziaktute leh upate awm khâwmnaah chuan ani chu an hruai ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Nimahsela, Peteran hla tak aṭangin amah chu a zui a, Puithiam Lalber in hual chhûng kawtlai thlengin; tin, a va lût a, a tâwpna hmu tûrin chhiahhlawhte zîngah a ṭhu ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Tin, amah an tihhlum theihna tûrin, puithiam lalte leh rorêltuho zawng zawng chuan Isua hêkna an zawng a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />hretu der tam tak lo kal mah sela, an hmu si lo. Nakinah erawh chuan mi pahnih an lo kal a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />“He mi hian, ‘Pathian biak in hi ṭhiata, ni thum chhûnga sa leh thei ka ni,’ a ti e,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Tichuan, puithiam lalber chu a ding chhuak a, a hnênah, “Eng mahin i chhâng lo maw? Hêng hian an hêkna che hi eng tizia nge ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Isua erawh chu a ngawi reng a. Tin, puithiam lalber chuan a hnênah, “Pathian nung chhâlin thu ka pe a che, Krista, Pathian Fapa chu i ni emaw, min hrilh rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />Isuan a hnênah “Ni e. Nimahsela, ka hrilh a che, tûn hnuah Mihring Fapa hi thiltihtheihna ding lama ṭhua, vân chhûm chunga lo kal in la hmu dâwn a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />Tin, puithiam lalber chuan a silhfênte a pawt thlêr a, “Pathian a sawi chhe ta: hretu dang engah nge kan ngaih tawh ang? Ngai teh u, Pathian a sawichhiatzia chu tûnah in hre tawh e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />Engtin nge in ngaih?” a ti a. Anni chuan, “Thi tlâk a ni,” tiin an chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" />Tin, a hmaiah chil an chhâk a, an hnek a; ṭhenkhat chuan, “Nang Krista, tuin nge bêng che? Min hrilh rawh,” tiin an bêng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" />Tin, Petera chu pâwnah, in hual chhûng kawtlaiah chuan a ṭhu a; tin, nula pakhat a hnênah a lo kal a, “Nang pawh Isua, Galili rama mi hnêna awm kha i nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" />Ani erawh chuan, “I thusawi chu ka hre hauh lo mai,” tiin an zaa hmaah a pha a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" />Tin, sumhmuna a va chhuah veleh nula dangin ani chu a hmu a, chuta awmte hnênah chuan, “He mi pawh hi Isua, Nazareth mi hnêna awm kha a nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" />Tin, “Chu mihring chu ka hre lo,” tiin, chhechhamin a pha leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" />Tin, rei lo tê achinah a kianga dingte chuan Petera hnênah, “Nang pawh an zînga mi i ni ngei mai, i ṭawngah a hriat alâwm,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="74" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “Chu mihring chu ka hre lo,” tiin, ânchhia inlawhin chhia a chham ta a. Tin, âr a khuang ta nghâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="75" style="v" />Tin, Petera chuan Isuan, “Âr a khuan hmain nangin vawi thum mi phat ang,” a tih thu kha a lo hre leh ta a. Tin, a chhuak a, a ṭap ta zawih zawih a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, zîng a lo nih chuan, puithiam lalte leh vântlâng upate zawng zawng chu Isua tihlum tûrin a chung thûah an inrâwn a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />tin, an phuar a, an hruai a, ram awptu Pilata hnênah an pe ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Juda, a mantîrtu khân Isua chu thiam loh an chantîr tih a hriat veleh a inchhîr a, tangka sawmthum kha puithiam lalte leh upate hnênah chuan a rawn la leh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Mi thiam thisen ka mantîr kha thil ka lo tisual a ni,” a ti a. Anni erawh chuan, “Chu chu kan tân eng nge pawi ang? Nangin i tih tihin ti rawh,” an tihsan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan tangka chu hmun thianghlimah chuan a paih lût a, a kal bo va; a va inâwk hlum ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, puithiam lalte chuan tangkate chu an la a, “Hei hi thawhlâwm bâwma dah a thiang lo ve, thisen man a ni si a,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tichuan, an inrâwn a, mikhualte phûmna tûrin bêlvawtu hmun chu an lei ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />(Chuvâng chuan a ni, chumi hmun chu tûn thlenga “Thisen Hmun” an tih tâk ni.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chumi lai chuan zâwlnei Jeremian, “Tin, tangka sawmthum, An chhiara man, Israel thlah, tuten emaw an chhiara man chu an la a, Lalpan min tiam angin Bêlvawtu hmun man atân an pe a,” tia a sawi kha a lo thleng ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Isua chu ram awptu hmaah chuan a ding a. Tin, ram awptu chuan, “Juda-te lal i ni em?” tiin a zâwt a. Tin, Isuan a hnênah, “Ni e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, puithiam lalte leh upaten an hêk laiin eng mahin a chhâng lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tichuan, Pilatan a hnênah, “An hêkna zozai che hi i hre lo vem ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, kam khat mahin a chhâng lo va; chutichuan, ram awptu chuan mak a ti hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, ram awptuin kût nîah chuan mi tâng pakhat, an duh apiang, mipuite chu a chhuahsak ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, chumi lai chuan mi tâng hmingthang tak, Barabba an tih chu an nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chutichuan, an rawn inkhâwm chuan Pilatan an hnênah, “Tu nge chhuahsak che u ila in duh? Barabba nge Isua, Krista an tiha chu?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />(Itsîkna avângin ani chu an mantîr tih a hre si a.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, rorêlna ṭhutphahah chuan a ṭhut laiin a nupuiin, “Kha mi fel tak chungah khân eng mah ti suh; vawiinah hian amah avângin mumangah thil tam tak ka tuar a ni,” tiin a chah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, puithiam lalte leh upaten Barabba dîla Isua tiboral tûrin mipuite chu an thlêm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ram awptu erawh chuan anniho chu a bia a, “Anni pahnih chu a tu zâwk nge chhuahsak che u ila in duh?” a ti leh a. Tin, anni chuan, “Barabba,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pilatan an hnênah, “Isua, Krista an tih hi engtin nge ka tih tâk ang le?” a ti a. An zain, “Ani chu kraws-ah khenbehtîr rawh,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “Engah maw? Eng nge a tihsual ni?” a ti a. Nimahsela, anniho chu, “Kraws-ah khenbehtîr rawh,” tiin an au chiam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tichuan, Pilata chuan eng mah a ti thei lo va, a buai deuh deuh zâwk dawn tih a hriatin tui a la a, mipuiho hmaah chuan a kut a sil a, “He mi fel thisenah hian ka thiang e; nangnin in tih tihin ti rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, vântlâng zawng zawng chuan, “A thisen chu keimahni chungah leh kan fate chungah awm rawh se,” tiin an chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chumi zawhah chuan Barabba chu a chhuahsak a; Isua erawh chu a vua a, kraws-a khenbeh tûrin a pe ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Chumi zawhah chuan, ram awptu sipaite chuan Isua chu lal inah an hruai lût a, an pâwla mi zawng zawng a hnênah an ko khâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tichuan, a puante an hlihsak a, puan sen an sintîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, hlîng lukhum an phiar a, an khumtîr a, a kut ding lamin luang an kentîr a; a hmaah an ṭhingṭhi a, “Chibai, Juda-te lal!” tiin nuihza siam nân an hmang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, amah chu chil an chhâk a, luang chu an lâksak a, a luah chuan an vua a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, nuihza siam nân an hman zawhin puan chu an hlihsak a, ama puante chu an sintîr leh a, kraws-a khenbeh tûrin an hruai ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, an kal chhuah laiin, Kurini khuaa mi, a hming Simona an hmu a; chu mi chu a kraws pu tûrin an man a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tin, Golgotha an tih hmun an lo thlenin (chu chu ‘Lu ruh hmun’ tihna a ni)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />uain thûr, englo khâ nêna pawlh, a in tûrin an pe a; nimahsela, a tem veleh a in duh ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tin, kraws-a an khenbeh zawhin ṭhum vâwrin a silhfênte chu an insem a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tin, chutah chuan an ṭhu a, an vêng a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />a hêkna, “He mi hi Isua, Juda-te Lal a ni,” tia ziak, a lû chungah an bel a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tin, a rual chuan suamhmang pahnih an khêngbet ve a, a ding lamah pakhat, a vei lamah pakhat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tin, mi vei apiangte chuan an lû thingin, “Nang, Pathian biak in ṭhiata ni thuma sa lehtu, intidam rawh; Pathian Fapa i nih chuan kraws ata kha lo chhuk ta che,” tiin an tiel a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Chutiang bawkin puithiam lalte chuan lehkhaziaktute nên tielin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />“Mi dang mah a tidam ṭhîn a, mahni a intidam thei si lo. Israel lal a ni alâwm, tûnah hian kraws ata chu lo chhuk ang hmiang; tichuan, amah chu kan ring ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Pathian a ring alâwm, amah hi a duh chuan tûnah hian chhandam rawh se; ‘Pathian Fapa ka ni,’ a ti si a,” an ti a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Suamhmang an khenbeh vete pawh chuan chutiang bawk chuan an tiel a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tin, chawfâk hun achin behliang mun hun thlengin khawvêl a lo thim ta vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tin, behliang mun hun lai vêl chuan Isua chu aw ring takin, “Eloi, eloi, lama sabakthani?” tiin a au chhuak a (chu chu, “Ka Pathian, ka Pathian, engah nge mi kalsan?” tihna a ni).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Tin, a kianga ding ṭhenkhatte chuan chu chu an hriatin, “He mi hian Elija a ko a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tin, an zînga mi pakhat chu a tlân ta nghâl a, sponj a la a, uain thûrin a chiah khat a, tiangah a târ a, a han intîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Tin, mi dangte chuan, “Awm rawh se; amah la thla tûrin Elija a lo kal emaw i en ang u,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Tin, Isua chu aw ring takin a au leh a, a thlarau a thlah ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Tin, ngai teh, Pathian biak in puanzâr chu a chung lam aṭangin a hnuai lam thlengin a lo thlêr chhuak ta a; tin, lîrte a lo nghîng a, lungpuite a lo khi chat a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />thlânte a lo inhawng a; mi thianghlim muhîl tawhte taksa tam tak pawh kaihthawhin an awm ta a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />chûngte chu, a thawhleh hnuah chuan thlân ata lo chhuakin khaw thianghlimah chuan an lût a, mi tam tak hnênah an inlâr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Tin, sipai za hotu leh a hnêna Isua vênga awm vete chuan, lîrnghîng leh thil awmziate chu an hmuhin an hlau ta êm êm a, “He mi hi Pathian Fapa a ni ngei mai,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Tin, chutah chuan hmeichhe tam tak, a rawngbâwlsak chung zêla Galili ram aṭanga Isua rawn zuitute chu an awm a, hla tak aṭangin an thlîr a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />chûng zîngah chuan Mari Magdalini te, Mari, Jakoba leh Josea nu te, Zebedaia fapate nu te an tel a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Tin, tlai lam a lo nih chuan mi hausa, a hming Josefa, Arimathai khuaa mi a lo kal a, amah ngei pawh chu Isua zirtîr a ni a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />chu mi chu Pilata hnênah a va kal a, Isua ruang chu a dîl a. Tin, Pilatan pe tûrin thu a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Tichuan, Josefa chuan ruang chu a la a, puan zai sîn fai takin a tuam a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />ama thlân thar, lung a ker kuakah chuan a zalh a; thlân kawngkaah chuan lung lian tak a lum a, a kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Tin, chutah chuan Mari Magdalini leh Mari dang chu an awm a, thlân hma zâwnah chuan an ṭhu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Tin, a tûkah chuan (chu chu Inrinni zawh tûk a ni) puithiam lalte leh Pharisaite chu Pilata hnênah an awm khâwm huai huai a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />“Ka pu, chu tihdertu chuan a dam lai khân, ‘Ni thum chinah ka tho leh ang,’ a ti tih kan hre reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />Chutichuan, thlân chu ni thum ni thlenga vêng ṭha tûrin thu pe rawh; chuti lo chuan a zirtîrten amah chu an va ru hlauh ang a, vântlâng hnênah, ‘Mitthi zîng ata a tho leh ta a ni,’ an ti dah ang e; tichuan, tihderna hnuhnûng zâwk chu a hmasa ai khân a ṭha lo lehzual ang,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />Pilatan an hnênah, “Vêngtu sipaite in nei alâwm; kal ula, in theih ang angin vên ṭhattîr ta che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />Chutichuan, vêngtu sipaite nên an va kal a, thlân chu an vên ṭhattîr a, lung chu an chhinchhiah a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Chawlhni tlai takah, ni sarih ni hmasa ber tûra khua a vâr dâwnin, Mari Magdalini leh Mari dang chu thlân en tûrin an kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, ngai teh, lîr nasa takin a lo nghîng a; Lalpa vântirhkoh vân ata a lo chhuk a, lung chu a rawn lum sawn a, a chungah a ṭhu ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A hmêl awmzia chu kâwlphe ang a ni a, a silhfên chu vûr angin a vâr a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />amah an hlauh avângin vêngtute chu an khûr a, mitthi ang maiin an lo awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, vântirhkoh chuan hmeichhiate chu a bia a, an hnênah, “Nangni chuan hlau suh u. Isua, an khenbeha kha in zawng tih ka hria e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hetah a awm tawh lo ve; a sawi ang ngeiin a thawhleh tawh kha. A mutna hmun hi rawn en teh mah u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, kal thuai ula, a zirtîrte hnênah, ‘Mitthi zîng ata a tho leh ta a ni; ngai teh u, Galili ramah in hmaah a kal e; chutah chuan amah chu in hmu ang,’ tiin hrilh rawh u. Ngai teh u, ka hrilh tawh che u hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, hlau leh lâwm êm êm chungin thlân aṭang chuan an kal thuai thuai a, a zirtîrte hrilh tûrin an tlân ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, ngai teh, Isuan anni chu a tâwk a, “Chibai u,” a ti a. Tichuan, anni chuan a kephahte chu an va vuan a, chibai an bûk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Isuan an hnênah, “Hlau suh u, kal ta ula, Galili rama kal tûrin ka unaute va hrilh rawh u; chutah chuan min hmu ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, an va kal lai chuan vêngtu sipai ṭhenkhat chu khawpuiah an va lût a, thil awmzia zawng zawng chu puithiam lalte hnênah an va hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, upate nên an inkhâwma, an inrâwn zawhin sipaite hnênah chuan tangka tam tak an pe a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“ ‘Zânah, kan muthilh hlânin a zirtîrte an lo kal a, amah chu an ru ta a ni,’ ti ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, ram awptuin chu chu a lo hriat chuan amah chu kan thlêm ang a, lungkham lovin kan siam ang che u,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chutichuan, tangka chu an la a, an hrilh ang zêl chuan an ti ta a; tichuan, tûn thlengin chumi thu chu Juda-te zîngah an la sawi huai huai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nimahsela, zirtîr sâwm leh pakhatte chu Galili ramah, Isuan tlâng a ruatsakah chuan an kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, amah an hmuh chuan chibai an bûk a; ṭhenkhat erawh chuan an ringhlel a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tichuan, Isua chu an hnênah a lo kal a, anniho chu a bia a, “Lei leh vâna thuneihna zawng zawng ka hnênah pêk a ni tawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chutichuan, kal ula, hnam tina mi zirtîrahte siam ula, Pa leh Fapa leh Thlarau Thianghlim hmingah chuan baptis ula,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />thu ka pêk zawng zawng che u pawm tûrin zirtîr rawh u. Tin, ngai teh u, kei kumkhuain, khawvêl tâwp thleng pawhin, in hnênah ka awm zêl ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
</usx>
